window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/a457-4ed5b72e07882165.json"]={sha256:"4ed5b72e07882165dbe4a6d590024525c7621ed453435470eb059ec041d59491",value:{"id":"a457","title":"自由電子雷射加速器","titleEn":"Free-electron-laser accelerators","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"以一座教學用 5.8 GeV、C 波段精簡型硬 X 光 FEL 為主線，從共振條件如何決定加速器長度出發，說明電子槍、射頻曲率線性化與磁束壓縮器如何產生 3 kA 的高品質束團，再把飛秒級縱向診斷、射頻抖動預算、波盪器軌道直線度與增益曲線驗收整合成可交接的 FEL 加速器工程紀錄。","summaryEn":"Follow a 5.8 GeV, C-band compact hard X-ray FEL used for teaching, starting from how the resonance condition sets linac length, see how the gun, RF-curvature linearization and chicanes produce a high-quality 3 kA bunch, then integrate femtosecond longitudinal diagnostics, the RF jitter budget, undulator trajectory straightness and gain-curve acceptance into a transferable FEL-accelerator engineering record.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-accelerators-detectors","subcategoryTitle":"加速器、光束線與粒子偵測器","subcategoryTitleEn":"Accelerators, beamlines and particle detectors","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-accelerators-detectors","learningTags":["optics","optics-accelerators-detectors","accelerator"],"architectureFamily":"accelerator","architectureNodes":[["光陰極射頻電子槍與驅動雷射","Photocathode RF gun and drive laser"],["注入器與雷射加熱器","Injector and laser heater"],["X 波段線性化與磁束壓縮器","X-band linearizer and chicanes"],["C 波段主直線加速器","C-band main linac"],["波盪器線與自種子","Undulator line and self-seeding"],["橫向偏轉腔與診斷","Transverse deflector and diagnostics"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[5,2],[5,4]],"diagram":{"type":"accelerator","labels":["光陰極射頻電子槍與驅動雷射","注入器與雷射加熱器","X 波段線性化與磁束壓縮器","C 波段主直線加速器","波盪器線與自種子"],"labelsEn":["Photocathode RF gun and drive laser","Injector and laser heater","X-band linearizer and chicanes","C-band main linac","Undulator line and self-seeding"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"精簡型硬 X 光 FEL 加速器練習：目標 0.1 nm（12.4 keV），λu = 15 mm、K = 1.2，需 E ≈ 5.8 GeV。電子槍：200 pC、Cs₂Te QE 1%，266 nm 雷射約 93 nJ；高斯束團 σ_t = 3 ps，峰值 I₀ = Q/(√(2π)σ_t) ≈ 26.6 A。要達 3 kA 需總壓縮 C ≈ 113，分配為 300 MeV 處第一級 C₁ = 10、約 2 GeV 處第二級 C₂ ≈ 11.3。雷射加熱器加入 15 keV 切片能量散佈，壓縮後放大為 15 keV×113 ≈ 1.7 MeV，在 5.8 GeV 為 2.9×10⁻⁴，仍小於 ρ ≈ 4.9×10⁻⁴，但餘量只有 1.7 倍；加熱器若設到 30 keV 就會超過 ρ。主加速：扣掉注入器 300 MeV 並補回 X 波段減速 17.6 MeV，以 28 MV/m 計約需 (5800 − 300 + 17.6)/28 ≈ 197 m 結構。飽和脈衝能量約 0.57 mJ（2.9×10¹¹ 個光子）；若最終能量抖動 2×10⁻⁴，光子能量逐發偏移約 5 eV。數值為教學假設，不代表任何實際設施規格。","textEn":"Compact hard X-ray FEL accelerator exercise: target 0.1 nm (12.4 keV) with λu = 15 mm and K = 1.2, requiring E ≈ 5.8 GeV. Gun: 200 pC from Cs2Te at 1% QE needs about 93 nJ of 266 nm laser; a Gaussian bunch with σ_t = 3 ps has peak I0 = Q/(√(2π)σ_t) ≈ 26.6 A. Reaching 3 kA needs total compression C ≈ 113, split as C1 = 10 at 300 MeV and C2 ≈ 11.3 near 2 GeV. A laser heater adding 15 keV of slice energy spread is magnified by compression to 15 keV×113 ≈ 1.7 MeV, which at 5.8 GeV is 2.9×10⁻⁴, still below ρ ≈ 4.9×10⁻⁴ but with only 1.7 times margin; a 30 keV heater setting would exceed ρ. Main linac: after the 300 MeV injector and making up 17.6 MeV of X-band deceleration, about (5800 − 300 + 17.6)/28 ≈ 197 m of structure at 28 MV/m. Saturation pulse energy is about 0.57 mJ (2.9×10¹¹ photons); a final energy jitter of 2×10⁻⁴ shifts photon energy by about 5 eV shot to shot. Values are teaching assumptions, not any facility's specification.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a457-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「共振條件決定加速器規模」與「電子束品質要求：發射度、能量散佈與峰值電流」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"The resonance condition sets the accelerator scale\" and \"Electron-beam requirements: emittance, energy spread and peak current\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a457-v12-01","title":"共振條件決定加速器規模：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"The resonance condition sets the accelerator scale: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「波盪器週期與電子能量」如何決定自由電子雷射加速器的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Undulator period and electron energy” determines the key performance of “Free-electron-laser accelerators”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"自由電子雷射的波長不是由增益介質決定，而是由電子能量與波盪器共同決定：λ = λu(1 + K²/2)/(2γ²)。要得到 0.1 nm 硬 X 光，γ 必須上萬，所需的直線加速器長度、隧道與建築成本因此由 λu 與 K 的選擇決定。縮短波盪器週期（真空內波盪器、小間隙）並提高加速梯度（C 波段 5.7 GHz 常溫結構），能把同樣波長所需的能量與長度降低數倍，這是 SACLA、SwissFEL 等精簡型設施的設計邏輯；代價是更小的間隙，以及更嚴格的尾場與束流品質要求。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「波盪器週期與電子能量」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A free-electron laser's wavelength is set not by a gain medium but jointly by electron energy and the undulator: λ = λu(1 + K²/2)/(2γ²). Reaching 0.1 nm hard X-rays requires γ above ten thousand, so the linac length, tunnel and building cost follow from the choice of λu and K. Shortening the undulator period with small-gap in-vacuum devices and raising the accelerating gradient with C-band 5.7 GHz normal-conducting structures cuts the energy and length needed for the same wavelength several-fold, which is the design logic of compact facilities such as SACLA and SwissFEL; the price is smaller gaps and tighter wakefield and beam-quality requirements. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Undulator period and electron energy”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：目標 λ = 0.1 nm：λu = 15 mm、K = 1.2 時 γ = √(λu(1 + K²/2)/(2λ)) = √(0.015×1.72/(2×10⁻¹⁰)) ≈ 11 360，E ≈ 5.8 GeV，以 28 MV/m 計約需 207 m 加速結構；若用 λu = 30 mm、K = 3.5，γ ≈ 32 690、E ≈ 16.7 GeV，需約 597 m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For λ = 0.1 nm with λu = 15 mm and K = 1.2, γ = √(λu(1 + K²/2)/(2λ)) = √(0.015×1.72/(2×10⁻¹⁰)) ≈ 11 360 and E ≈ 5.8 GeV, about 207 m of structure at 28 MV/m; with λu = 30 mm and K = 3.5, γ ≈ 32 690 and E ≈ 16.7 GeV, needing about 597 m.","failure":"常見誤解：「FEL 的輸出波長由雷射介質決定，與電子能量無關。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"An FEL's output wavelength is set by a lasing medium and is independent of electron energy.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「波盪器週期與電子能量」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Undulator period and electron energy”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-01-k1","title":"共振條件決定加速器規模","titleEn":"The resonance condition sets the accelerator scale","text":"自由電子雷射的波長不是由增益介質決定，而是由電子能量與波盪器共同決定：λ = λu(1 + K²/2)/(2γ²)。要得到 0.1 nm 硬 X 光，γ 必須上萬，所需的直線加速器長度、隧道與建築成本因此由 λu 與 K 的選擇決定。","textEn":"A free-electron laser's wavelength is set not by a gain medium but jointly by electron energy and the undulator: λ = λu(1 + K²/2)/(2γ²). Reaching 0.1 nm hard X-rays requires γ above ten thousand, so the linac length, tunnel and building cost follow from the choice of λu and K.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：FEL 的輸出波長由雷射介質決定，與電子能量無關。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: An FEL's output wavelength is set by a lasing medium and is independent of electron energy. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「共振條件決定加速器規模」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"The resonance condition sets the accelerator scale\" is correct?","options":["FEL 的輸出波長由雷射介質決定，與電子能量無關。","自由電子雷射的波長不是由增益介質決定，而是由電子能量與波盪器共同決定：λ = λu(1 + K²/2)/(2γ²)。","電子束能量散佈越小越好，降到零最理想。"],"optionsEn":["An FEL's output wavelength is set by a lasing medium and is independent of electron energy.","A free-electron laser's wavelength is set not by a gain medium but jointly by electron energy and the undulator: λ = λu(1 + K²/2)/(2γ²).","The smaller the energy spread the better; zero would be ideal."],"answer":1,"explanation":"自由電子雷射的波長不是由增益介質決定，而是由電子能量與波盪器共同決定：λ = λu(1 + K²/2)/(2γ²)。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A free-electron laser's wavelength is set not by a gain medium but jointly by electron energy and the undulator: λ = λu(1 + K²/2)/(2γ²). The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a457-v12-02","title":"共振條件決定加速器規模：定量估算","titleEn":"The resonance condition sets the accelerator scale: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「波盪器週期與電子能量」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Undulator period and electron energy” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：目標 λ = 0.1 nm：λu = 15 mm、K = 1.2 時 γ = √(λu(1 + K²/2)/(2λ)) = √(0.015×1.72/(2×10⁻¹⁰)) ≈ 11 360，E ≈ 5.8 GeV，以 28 MV/m 計約需 207 m 加速結構；若用 λu = 30 mm、K = 3.5，γ ≈ 32 690、E ≈ 16.7 GeV，需約 597 m。固定能量下把 K 從 1.2 關到 0.8，波長乘以 (1 + 0.32)/(1 + 0.72) ≈ 0.77，0.1 nm 變成約 0.077 nm。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For λ = 0.1 nm with λu = 15 mm and K = 1.2, γ = √(λu(1 + K²/2)/(2λ)) = √(0.015×1.72/(2×10⁻¹⁰)) ≈ 11 360 and E ≈ 5.8 GeV, about 207 m of structure at 28 MV/m; with λu = 30 mm and K = 3.5, γ ≈ 32 690 and E ≈ 16.7 GeV, needing about 597 m. At fixed energy, closing K from 1.2 to 0.8 multiplies the wavelength by (1 + 0.32)/(1 + 0.72) ≈ 0.77, turning 0.1 nm into about 0.077 nm. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以能譜分析段（偏轉磁鐵加螢光屏）量最終電子能量，並以單色器或光譜儀量自發輻射的諧波峰，兩者代入共振式反解 K，與波盪器磁場量測給出的 K 比較，差異應在 10⁻³ 等級以內。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure the final electron energy with a spectrometer dipole and screen, measure the spontaneous-emission harmonic peak with a monochromator or spectrometer, invert the resonance relation for K and compare with the K from undulator field measurements, expecting agreement at the 10⁻³ level.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"目標 λ = 0.1 nm：λu = 15 mm、K = 1.2 時 γ = √(λu(1 + K²/2)/(2λ)) = √(0.015×1.72/(2×10⁻¹⁰)) ≈ 11 360，E ≈ 5.8 GeV，以 28 MV/m 計約需 207 m 加速結構；若用 λu = 30 mm、K = 3.5，γ ≈ 32 690、E ≈ 16.7 GeV，需約 597 m。固定能量下把 K 從 1.2 關到 0.8，波長乘以 (1 + 0.32)/(1 + 0.72) ≈ 0.77，0.1 nm 變成約 0.077 nm。","textEn":"For λ = 0.1 nm with λu = 15 mm and K = 1.2, γ = √(λu(1 + K²/2)/(2λ)) = √(0.015×1.72/(2×10⁻¹⁰)) ≈ 11 360 and E ≈ 5.8 GeV, about 207 m of structure at 28 MV/m; with λu = 30 mm and K = 3.5, γ ≈ 32 690 and E ≈ 16.7 GeV, needing about 597 m. At fixed energy, closing K from 1.2 to 0.8 multiplies the wavelength by (1 + 0.32)/(1 + 0.72) ≈ 0.77, turning 0.1 nm into about 0.077 nm.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「共振條件決定加速器規模」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"The resonance condition sets the accelerator scale\", which statement holds?","options":["只要加速到夠高能量，束團長度就會自動變短。","射頻抖動只影響電子能量，不影響 X 光脈衝的到達時間。","目標 λ = 0.1 nm：λu = 15 mm、K = 1.2 時 γ = √(λu(1 + K²/2)/(2λ)) = √(0.015×1.72/(2×10⁻¹⁰)) ≈ 11 360，E ≈ 5.8 GeV，以 28 MV/m 計約需 207 m 加速結構。"],"optionsEn":["Accelerating to high enough energy automatically shortens the bunch.","RF jitter affects only electron energy, not the X-ray pulse arrival time.","For λ = 0.1 nm with λu = 15 mm and K = 1.2, γ = √(λu(1 + K²/2)/(2λ)) = √(0.015×1.72/(2×10⁻¹⁰)) ≈ 11 360 and E ≈ 5.8 GeV, about 207 m of structure at 28 MV/m."],"answer":2,"explanation":"目標 λ = 0.1 nm：λu = 15 mm、K = 1.2 時 γ = √(λu(1 + K²/2)/(2λ)) = √(0.015×1.72/(2×10⁻¹⁰)) ≈ 11 360，E ≈ 5.8 GeV，以 28 MV/m 計約需 207 m 加速結構；若用 λu = 30 mm、K = 3.5，γ ≈ 32 690、E ≈ 16.7 GeV，需約 597 m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For λ = 0.1 nm with λu = 15 mm and K = 1.2, γ = √(λu(1 + K²/2)/(2λ)) = √(0.015×1.72/(2×10⁻¹⁰)) ≈ 11 360 and E ≈ 5.8 GeV, about 207 m of structure at 28 MV/m; with λu = 30 mm and K = 3.5, γ ≈ 32 690 and E ≈ 16.7 GeV, needing about 597 m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a457-v12-03","title":"共振條件決定加速器規模：量測與驗證","titleEn":"The resonance condition sets the accelerator scale: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「波盪器週期與電子能量」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Undulator period and electron energy” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以能譜分析段（偏轉磁鐵加螢光屏）量最終電子能量，並以單色器或光譜儀量自發輻射的諧波峰，兩者代入共振式反解 K，與波盪器磁場量測給出的 K 比較，差異應在 10⁻³ 等級以內。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure the final electron energy with a spectrometer dipole and screen, measure the spontaneous-emission harmonic peak with a monochromator or spectrometer, invert the resonance relation for K and compare with the K from undulator field measurements, expecting agreement at the 10⁻³ level. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：能譜分析磁鐵未經校正，實際電子能量比標示低 0.3%，光子能量隨之低 0.6%；使用者在吸收邊附近的實驗全部偏移，波盪器間隙表卻被誤認為有誤而遭錯誤修改。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: An uncalibrated spectrometer dipole leaves the true electron energy 0.3% below the displayed value, so photon energy is 0.6% low; every user experiment near an absorption edge is shifted, and the undulator gap table is wrongly blamed and wrongly edited.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以能譜分析段（偏轉磁鐵加螢光屏）量最終電子能量，並以單色器或光譜儀量自發輻射的諧波峰，兩者代入共振式反解 K，與波盪器磁場量測給出的 K 比較，差異應在 10⁻³ 等級以內。","textEn":"Measure the final electron energy with a spectrometer dipole and screen, measure the spontaneous-emission harmonic peak with a monochromator or spectrometer, invert the resonance relation for K and compare with the K from undulator field measurements, expecting agreement at the 10⁻³ level.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「共振條件決定加速器規模」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"The resonance condition sets the accelerator scale\"?","options":["以能譜分析段（偏轉磁鐵加螢光屏）量最終電子能量，並以單色器或光譜儀量自發輻射的諧波峰，兩者代入共振式反解 K，與波盪器磁場量測給出的 K 比較，差異應在 10⁻³ 等級以內。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","波盪器只要磁場合格，電子軌道誤差影響不大。"],"optionsEn":["Measure the final electron energy with a spectrometer dipole and screen, measure the spontaneous-emission harmonic peak with a monochromator or spectrometer, invert the resonance relation for K and compare with the K from undulator field measurements, expecting agreement at the 10⁻³ level.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","If the undulator field passes, electron orbit errors matter little."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以能譜分析段（偏轉磁鐵加螢光屏）量最終電子能量，並以單色器或光譜儀量自發輻射的諧波峰，兩者代入共振式反解 K，與波盪器磁場量測給出的 K 比較，差異應在 10⁻³ 等級以內。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure the final electron energy with a spectrometer dipole and screen, measure the spontaneous-emission harmonic peak with a monochromator or spectrometer, invert the resonance relation for K and compare with the K from undulator field measurements, expecting agreement at the 10⁻³ level. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a457-v12-04","title":"共振條件決定加速器規模：失效診斷","titleEn":"The resonance condition sets the accelerator scale: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「波盪器週期與電子能量」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Undulator period and electron energy” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"能譜分析磁鐵未經校正，實際電子能量比標示低 0.3%，光子能量隨之低 0.6%；使用者在吸收邊附近的實驗全部偏移，波盪器間隙表卻被誤認為有誤而遭錯誤修改。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"An uncalibrated spectrometer dipole leaves the true electron energy 0.3% below the displayed value, so photon energy is 0.6% low; every user experiment near an absorption edge is shifted, and the undulator gap table is wrongly blamed and wrongly edited. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：縮短波盪器週期（真空內波盪器、小間隙）並提高加速梯度（C 波段 5.7 GHz 常溫結構），能把同樣波長所需的能量與長度降低數倍，這是 SACLA、SwissFEL 等精簡型設施的設計邏輯；代價是更小的間隙，以及更嚴格的尾場與束流品質要求。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Shortening the undulator period with small-gap in-vacuum devices and raising the accelerating gradient with C-band 5.7 GHz normal-conducting structures cuts the energy and length needed for the same wavelength several-fold, which is the design logic of compact facilities such as SACLA and SwissFEL; the price is smaller gaps and tighter wakefield and beam-quality requirements.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「FEL 的輸出波長由雷射介質決定，與電子能量無關。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"An FEL's output wavelength is set by a lasing medium and is independent of electron energy.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"能譜分析磁鐵未經校正，實際電子能量比標示低 0.3%，光子能量隨之低 0.6%；使用者在吸收邊附近的實驗全部偏移，波盪器間隙表卻被誤認為有誤而遭錯誤修改。","textEn":"An uncalibrated spectrometer dipole leaves the true electron energy 0.3% below the displayed value, so photon energy is 0.6% low; every user experiment near an absorption edge is shifted, and the undulator gap table is wrongly blamed and wrongly edited.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「共振條件決定加速器規模」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"The resonance condition sets the accelerator scale\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","能譜分析磁鐵未經校正，實際電子能量比標示低 0.3%，光子能量隨之低 0.6%；使用者在吸收邊附近的實驗全部偏移，波盪器間隙表卻被誤認為有誤而遭錯誤修改。","電子束能量散佈越小越好，降到零最理想。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","An uncalibrated spectrometer dipole leaves the true electron energy 0.3% below the displayed value, so photon energy is 0.6% low.","The smaller the energy spread the better; zero would be ideal."],"answer":1,"explanation":"能譜分析磁鐵未經校正，實際電子能量比標示低 0.3%，光子能量隨之低 0.6%；使用者在吸收邊附近的實驗全部偏移，波盪器間隙表卻被誤認為有誤而遭錯誤修改。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"An uncalibrated spectrometer dipole leaves the true electron energy 0.3% below the displayed value, so photon energy is 0.6% low; every user experiment near an absorption edge is shifted, and the undulator gap table is wrongly blamed and wrongly edited. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a457-v12-05","title":"電子束品質要求：發射度、能量散佈與峰值電流：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Electron-beam requirements: emittance, energy spread and peak current: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「束流品質規格表」如何決定自由電子雷射加速器的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Beam-quality specification sheet” determines the key performance of “Free-electron-laser accelerators”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"SASE 增益要求電子束同時滿足三個條件：橫向上，幾何發射度 ε_n/γ 最好小於 λ/4π，使電子束與輻射模式重疊；縱向上，切片能量散佈要小於 Pierce 參數 ρ，否則電子的共振波長被抹開；峰值電流要達到數 kA，ρ 才夠大、增益長度才夠短。三者互相牽制：壓縮提高電流，同時放大能量散佈，並可能因相干同步輻射劣化發射度；能量散佈過小又會引發微束團不穩定，因此加速器設計是在這些規格之間取得平衡。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「束流品質規格表」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"SASE gain requires the electron beam to satisfy three conditions at once: transversely, the geometric emittance ε_n/γ should be below λ/4π so the beam overlaps the radiation mode; longitudinally, the slice energy spread must be below the Pierce parameter ρ or the resonant wavelength is smeared; and the peak current must reach several kiloamperes so that ρ is large and the gain length short. The three pull against each other: compression raises current but magnifies energy spread and can degrade emittance through coherent synchrotron radiation, while too small an energy spread triggers the microbunching instability, so the accelerator design is a balance among these specifications. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Beam-quality specification sheet”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：5.8 GeV（γ ≈ 11 360）、λ = 0.1 nm：λ/4π ≈ 7.96 pm，相當於 ε_n ≤ γλ/4π ≈ 90 nm；實際 ε_n = 0.4 µm 對應幾何 35 pm，超出約 4.4 倍，需由三維增益長度修正承擔。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: At 5.8 GeV (γ ≈ 11 360) and λ = 0.1 nm, λ/4π ≈ 7.96 pm, equivalent to ε_n ≤ γλ/4π ≈ 90 nm; a real ε_n = 0.4 µm gives a geometric 35 pm, about 4.4 times over, which the three-dimensional gain-length correction must absorb.","failure":"常見誤解：「電子束能量散佈越小越好，降到零最理想。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The smaller the energy spread the better; zero would be ideal.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「束流品質規格表」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Beam-quality specification sheet”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-05-k1","title":"電子束品質要求：發射度、能量散佈與峰值電流","titleEn":"Electron-beam requirements: emittance, energy spread and peak current","text":"SASE 增益要求電子束同時滿足三個條件：橫向上，幾何發射度 ε_n/γ 最好小於 λ/4π，使電子束與輻射模式重疊；縱向上，切片能量散佈要小於 Pierce 參數 ρ，否則電子的共振波長被抹開；峰值電流要達到數 kA，ρ 才夠大、增益長度才夠短。三者互相牽制：壓縮提高電流，同時放大能量散佈，並可能因相干同步輻射劣化發射度；能量散佈過小又會引發微束團不穩定，因此加速器設計是在這些規格之間取得平衡。","textEn":"SASE gain requires the electron beam to satisfy three conditions at once: transversely, the geometric emittance ε_n/γ should be below λ/4π so the beam overlaps the radiation mode; longitudinally, the slice energy spread must be below the Pierce parameter ρ or the resonant wavelength is smeared; and the peak current must reach several kiloamperes so that ρ is large and the gain length short. The three pull against each other: compression raises current but magnifies energy spread and can degrade emittance through coherent synchrotron radiation, while too small an energy spread triggers the microbunching instability, so the accelerator design is a balance among these specifications.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：電子束能量散佈越小越好，降到零最理想。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The smaller the energy spread the better; zero would be ideal. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「電子束品質要求：發射度、能量散佈與峰值電流」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Electron-beam requirements: emittance, energy spread and peak current\" is correct?","options":["電子束能量散佈越小越好，降到零最理想。","電子槍之後的加速器可以降低正規化發射度，補回電子槍的不足。","SASE 增益要求電子束同時滿足三個條件：橫向上，幾何發射度 ε_n/γ 最好小於 λ/4π，使電子束與輻射模式重疊。"],"optionsEn":["The smaller the energy spread the better; zero would be ideal.","The linac after the gun can reduce normalized emittance and make up for a poor gun.","SASE gain requires the electron beam to satisfy three conditions at once: transversely, the geometric emittance ε_n/γ should be below λ/4π so the beam overlaps the radiation mode."],"answer":2,"explanation":"SASE 增益要求電子束同時滿足三個條件：橫向上，幾何發射度 ε_n/γ 最好小於 λ/4π，使電子束與輻射模式重疊；縱向上，切片能量散佈要小於 Pierce 參數 ρ，否則電子的共振波長被抹開；峰值電流要達到數 kA，ρ 才夠大、增益長度才夠短。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"SASE gain requires the electron beam to satisfy three conditions at once: transversely, the geometric emittance ε_n/γ should be below λ/4π so the beam overlaps the radiation mode; longitudinally, the slice energy spread must be below the Pierce parameter ρ or the resonant wavelength is smeared; and the peak current must reach several kiloamperes so that ρ is large and the gain length short. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a457-v12-06","title":"電子束品質要求：發射度、能量散佈與峰值電流：定量估算","titleEn":"Electron-beam requirements: emittance, energy spread and peak current: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「束流品質規格表」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Beam-quality specification sheet” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：5.8 GeV（γ ≈ 11 360）、λ = 0.1 nm：λ/4π ≈ 7.96 pm，相當於 ε_n ≤ γλ/4π ≈ 90 nm；實際 ε_n = 0.4 µm 對應幾何 35 pm，超出約 4.4 倍，需由三維增益長度修正承擔。I = 3 kA、K = 1.2、σ_x = 20 µm 時 ρ ≈ 4.9×10⁻⁴，一維增益長度 L_g = λu/(4π√3ρ) ≈ 1.39 m。切片能量散佈 0.5 MeV 對應 8.6×10⁻⁵，約為 ρ 的 1/6，滿足要求。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: At 5.8 GeV (γ ≈ 11 360) and λ = 0.1 nm, λ/4π ≈ 7.96 pm, equivalent to ε_n ≤ γλ/4π ≈ 90 nm; a real ε_n = 0.4 µm gives a geometric 35 pm, about 4.4 times over, which the three-dimensional gain-length correction must absorb. With I = 3 kA, K = 1.2 and σ_x = 20 µm, ρ ≈ 4.9×10⁻⁴ and the one-dimensional gain length L_g = λu/(4π√3ρ) ≈ 1.39 m. A slice energy spread of 0.5 MeV is 8.6×10⁻⁵, about one sixth of ρ, which satisfies the requirement. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：把規格表的每一項對應到一個量測：以四極掃描或多屏法量投影與切片發射度，以橫向偏轉腔加能譜儀量切片能量散佈與電流分佈，再把量得的參數代入 Ming Xie 等三維增益長度擬合式，預測增益長度並與實測增益曲線比對。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Map every line of the specification sheet to a measurement: projected and slice emittance by quadrupole scans or multi-screen methods, slice energy spread and current profile with a transverse deflector plus spectrometer, then insert the measured parameters into a three-dimensional gain-length fit such as Ming Xie's to predict the gain length and compare with the measured gain curve.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"5.8 GeV（γ ≈ 11 360）、λ = 0.1 nm：λ/4π ≈ 7.96 pm，相當於 ε_n ≤ γλ/4π ≈ 90 nm；實際 ε_n = 0.4 µm 對應幾何 35 pm，超出約 4.4 倍，需由三維增益長度修正承擔。I = 3 kA、K = 1.2、σ_x = 20 µm 時 ρ ≈ 4.9×10⁻⁴，一維增益長度 L_g = λu/(4π√3ρ) ≈ 1.39 m。切片能量散佈 0.5 MeV 對應 8.6×10⁻⁵，約為 ρ 的 1/6，滿足要求。","textEn":"At 5.8 GeV (γ ≈ 11 360) and λ = 0.1 nm, λ/4π ≈ 7.96 pm, equivalent to ε_n ≤ γλ/4π ≈ 90 nm; a real ε_n = 0.4 µm gives a geometric 35 pm, about 4.4 times over, which the three-dimensional gain-length correction must absorb. With I = 3 kA, K = 1.2 and σ_x = 20 µm, ρ ≈ 4.9×10⁻⁴ and the one-dimensional gain length L_g = λu/(4π√3ρ) ≈ 1.39 m. A slice energy spread of 0.5 MeV is 8.6×10⁻⁵, about one sixth of ρ, which satisfies the requirement.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「電子束品質要求：發射度、能量散佈與峰值電流」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Electron-beam requirements: emittance, energy spread and peak current\", which statement holds?","options":["5.8 GeV（γ ≈ 11 360）、λ = 0.1 nm：λ/4π ≈ 7.96 pm，相當於 ε_n ≤ γλ/4π ≈ 90 nm。","屏上看到的垂直長度就是束團長度，不必扣除束流本身的尺寸。","波盪器只要磁場合格，電子軌道誤差影響不大。"],"optionsEn":["At 5.8 GeV (γ ≈ 11 360) and λ = 0.1 nm, λ/4π ≈ 7.96 pm, equivalent to ε_n ≤ γλ/4π ≈ 90 nm.","The vertical length on the screen equals the bunch length with no need to remove the beam's own size.","If the undulator field passes, electron orbit errors matter little."],"answer":0,"explanation":"5.8 GeV（γ ≈ 11 360）、λ = 0.1 nm：λ/4π ≈ 7.96 pm，相當於 ε_n ≤ γλ/4π ≈ 90 nm；實際 ε_n = 0.4 µm 對應幾何 35 pm，超出約 4.4 倍，需由三維增益長度修正承擔。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"At 5.8 GeV (γ ≈ 11 360) and λ = 0.1 nm, λ/4π ≈ 7.96 pm, equivalent to ε_n ≤ γλ/4π ≈ 90 nm; a real ε_n = 0.4 µm gives a geometric 35 pm, about 4.4 times over, which the three-dimensional gain-length correction must absorb. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a457-v12-07","title":"電子束品質要求：發射度、能量散佈與峰值電流：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Electron-beam requirements: emittance, energy spread and peak current: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「束流品質規格表」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Beam-quality specification sheet” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"把規格表的每一項對應到一個量測：以四極掃描或多屏法量投影與切片發射度，以橫向偏轉腔加能譜儀量切片能量散佈與電流分佈，再把量得的參數代入 Ming Xie 等三維增益長度擬合式，預測增益長度並與實測增益曲線比對。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Map every line of the specification sheet to a measurement: projected and slice emittance by quadrupole scans or multi-screen methods, slice energy spread and current profile with a transverse deflector plus spectrometer, then insert the measured parameters into a three-dimensional gain-length fit such as Ming Xie's to predict the gain length and compare with the measured gain curve. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：只量投影發射度就宣告合格，卻漏掉束團中心切片因相干同步輻射而歪斜；只有少數切片真正對準波盪器軸，脈衝能量只有預期的幾分之一，而且對軌道微調極度敏感。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Declaring success from projected emittance alone misses slices tilted by coherent synchrotron radiation in the bunch core; only a few slices align with the undulator axis, pulse energy is a fraction of expectation and extremely sensitive to orbit tweaks.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"把規格表的每一項對應到一個量測：以四極掃描或多屏法量投影與切片發射度，以橫向偏轉腔加能譜儀量切片能量散佈與電流分佈，再把量得的參數代入 Ming Xie 等三維增益長度擬合式，預測增益長度並與實測增益曲線比對。","textEn":"Map every line of the specification sheet to a measurement: projected and slice emittance by quadrupole scans or multi-screen methods, slice energy spread and current profile with a transverse deflector plus spectrometer, then insert the measured parameters into a three-dimensional gain-length fit such as Ming Xie's to predict the gain length and compare with the measured gain curve.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「電子束品質要求：發射度、能量散佈與峰值電流」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Electron-beam requirements: emittance, energy spread and peak current\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","把規格表的每一項對應到一個量測：以四極掃描或多屏法量投影與切片發射度，以橫向偏轉腔加能譜儀量切片能量散佈與電流分佈，再把量得的參數代入 Ming Xie 等三維增益長度擬合式，預測增益長度並與實測增益曲線比對。","偵測器上看到 X 光，就表示 FEL 已經飽和。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Map every line of the specification sheet to a measurement: projected and slice emittance by quadrupole scans or multi-screen methods, slice energy spread and current profile with a transverse deflector plus spectrometer, then insert the measured parameters into a three-dimensional gain-length fit such as Ming Xie's to predict the gain length and compare with the measured gain curve.","Seeing X-rays on the detector means the FEL has saturated."],"answer":1,"explanation":"把規格表的每一項對應到一個量測：以四極掃描或多屏法量投影與切片發射度，以橫向偏轉腔加能譜儀量切片能量散佈與電流分佈，再把量得的參數代入 Ming Xie 等三維增益長度擬合式，預測增益長度並與實測增益曲線比對。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Map every line of the specification sheet to a measurement: projected and slice emittance by quadrupole scans or multi-screen methods, slice energy spread and current profile with a transverse deflector plus spectrometer, then insert the measured parameters into a three-dimensional gain-length fit such as Ming Xie's to predict the gain length and compare with the measured gain curve. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a457-v12-08","title":"電子束品質要求：發射度、能量散佈與峰值電流：失效診斷","titleEn":"Electron-beam requirements: emittance, energy spread and peak current: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「束流品質規格表」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Beam-quality specification sheet” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"只量投影發射度就宣告合格，卻漏掉束團中心切片因相干同步輻射而歪斜；只有少數切片真正對準波盪器軸，脈衝能量只有預期的幾分之一，而且對軌道微調極度敏感。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Declaring success from projected emittance alone misses slices tilted by coherent synchrotron radiation in the bunch core; only a few slices align with the undulator axis, pulse energy is a fraction of expectation and extremely sensitive to orbit tweaks. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：三者互相牽制：壓縮提高電流，同時放大能量散佈，並可能因相干同步輻射劣化發射度；能量散佈過小又會引發微束團不穩定，因此加速器設計是在這些規格之間取得平衡。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The three pull against each other: compression raises current but magnifies energy spread and can degrade emittance through coherent synchrotron radiation, while too small an energy spread triggers the microbunching instability, so the accelerator design is a balance among these specifications.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「電子束能量散佈越小越好，降到零最理想。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The smaller the energy spread the better; zero would be ideal.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只量投影發射度就宣告合格，卻漏掉束團中心切片因相干同步輻射而歪斜；只有少數切片真正對準波盪器軸，脈衝能量只有預期的幾分之一，而且對軌道微調極度敏感。","textEn":"Declaring success from projected emittance alone misses slices tilted by coherent synchrotron radiation in the bunch core; only a few slices align with the undulator axis, pulse energy is a fraction of expectation and extremely sensitive to orbit tweaks.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「電子束品質要求：發射度、能量散佈與峰值電流」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Electron-beam requirements: emittance, energy spread and peak current\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","電子槍之後的加速器可以降低正規化發射度，補回電子槍的不足。","只量投影發射度就宣告合格，卻漏掉束團中心切片因相干同步輻射而歪斜；只有少數切片真正對準波盪器軸，脈衝能量只有預期的幾分之一，而且對軌道微調極度敏感。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","The linac after the gun can reduce normalized emittance and make up for a poor gun.","Declaring success from projected emittance alone misses slices tilted by coherent synchrotron radiation in the bunch core."],"answer":2,"explanation":"只量投影發射度就宣告合格，卻漏掉束團中心切片因相干同步輻射而歪斜；只有少數切片真正對準波盪器軸，脈衝能量只有預期的幾分之一，而且對軌道微調極度敏感。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Declaring success from projected emittance alone misses slices tilted by coherent synchrotron radiation in the bunch core; only a few slices align with the undulator axis, pulse energy is a fraction of expectation and extremely sensitive to orbit tweaks. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a457-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「光陰極射頻電子槍：量子效率、熱發射度與空間電荷」與「加速結構、射頻曲率線性化與磁束壓縮器」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Photocathode RF gun: quantum efficiency, thermal emittance and space charge\" and \"Accelerating structures, RF-curvature linearization and chicanes\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a457-v12-09","title":"光陰極射頻電子槍：量子效率、熱發射度與空間電荷：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Photocathode RF gun: quantum efficiency, thermal emittance and space charge: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「光陰極與驅動雷射」如何決定自由電子雷射加速器的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Photocathode and drive laser” determines the key performance of “Free-electron-laser accelerators”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"FEL 的電子束品質在電子槍就大致決定，後段加速只能保持而無法改善。驅動雷射以紫外脈衝照射銅或 Cs₂Te 光陰極，量子效率（QE）決定所需雷射能量；電子離開陰極時帶有平均橫向能量（MTE），形成與雷射光斑大小成正比的熱發射度。陰極表面約 100 MV/m 的射頻電場要快速把電子加速到相對論速度，以壓住空間電荷力；陰極面上的電荷面密度不能超過鏡像電荷極限 ε₀E，電子槍後的螺線管再做發射度補償，把各切片的橫向相空間重新對齊。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「光陰極與驅動雷射」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"An FEL's beam quality is largely fixed at the gun; downstream acceleration can preserve but not improve it. A drive laser illuminates a copper or Cs2Te photocathode with ultraviolet pulses, and the quantum efficiency (QE) sets the laser energy needed; electrons leave the cathode with a mean transverse energy (MTE) that produces a thermal emittance proportional to the laser spot size. An RF field of about 100 MV/m at the cathode must quickly accelerate electrons to relativistic speed to suppress space-charge forces; the surface charge density cannot exceed the image-charge limit ε0E, and a solenoid after the gun performs emittance compensation to realign the transverse phase space of the slices. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Photocathode and drive laser”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：200 pC 等於 1.25×10⁹ 個電子，266 nm 光子能量 4.66 eV。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: 200 pC is 1.25×10⁹ electrons, and a 266 nm photon carries 4.66 eV.","failure":"常見誤解：「電子槍之後的加速器可以降低正規化發射度，補回電子槍的不足。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The linac after the gun can reduce normalized emittance and make up for a poor gun.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「光陰極與驅動雷射」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Photocathode and drive laser”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-09-k1","title":"光陰極射頻電子槍：量子效率、熱發射度與空間電荷","titleEn":"Photocathode RF gun: quantum efficiency, thermal emittance and space charge","text":"FEL 的電子束品質在電子槍就大致決定，後段加速只能保持而無法改善。驅動雷射以紫外脈衝照射銅或 Cs₂Te 光陰極，量子效率（QE）決定所需雷射能量；電子離開陰極時帶有平均橫向能量（MTE），形成與雷射光斑大小成正比的熱發射度。","textEn":"An FEL's beam quality is largely fixed at the gun; downstream acceleration can preserve but not improve it. A drive laser illuminates a copper or Cs2Te photocathode with ultraviolet pulses, and the quantum efficiency (QE) sets the laser energy needed; electrons leave the cathode with a mean transverse energy (MTE) that produces a thermal emittance proportional to the laser spot size.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：電子槍之後的加速器可以降低正規化發射度，補回電子槍的不足。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The linac after the gun can reduce normalized emittance and make up for a poor gun. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「光陰極射頻電子槍：量子效率、熱發射度與空間電荷」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Photocathode RF gun: quantum efficiency, thermal emittance and space charge\" is correct?","options":["FEL 的電子束品質在電子槍就大致決定，後段加速只能保持而無法改善。","電子槍之後的加速器可以降低正規化發射度，補回電子槍的不足。","只要加速到夠高能量，束團長度就會自動變短。"],"optionsEn":["An FEL's beam quality is largely fixed at the gun; downstream acceleration can preserve but not improve it.","The linac after the gun can reduce normalized emittance and make up for a poor gun.","Accelerating to high enough energy automatically shortens the bunch."],"answer":0,"explanation":"FEL 的電子束品質在電子槍就大致決定，後段加速只能保持而無法改善。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"An FEL's beam quality is largely fixed at the gun; downstream acceleration can preserve but not improve it. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a457-v12-10","title":"光陰極射頻電子槍：量子效率、熱發射度與空間電荷：定量估算","titleEn":"Photocathode RF gun: quantum efficiency, thermal emittance and space charge: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「光陰極與驅動雷射」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Photocathode and drive laser” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：200 pC 等於 1.25×10⁹ 個電子，266 nm 光子能量 4.66 eV。Cs₂Te 的 QE = 1% 時雷射能量 1.25×10⁹/0.01×4.66 eV ≈ 93 nJ；銅陰極 QE = 5×10⁻⁵ 時需約 18.6 µJ。熱發射度 ε_th = σ_x·√(MTE/mc²)，取 0.9 µm/mm（MTE ≈ 0.41 eV）、σ_x = 0.2 mm 得 0.18 µm。陰極場 100 MV/m 的面電荷極限 ε₀E ≈ 8.85×10⁻⁴ C/m²，半徑 0.4 mm 的光斑最多約 0.45 nC，200 pC 已用掉 45%。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: 200 pC is 1.25×10⁹ electrons, and a 266 nm photon carries 4.66 eV. With a Cs2Te QE of 1% the laser energy is 1.25×10⁹/0.01×4.66 eV ≈ 93 nJ; a copper cathode at QE = 5×10⁻⁵ needs about 18.6 µJ. Thermal emittance ε_th = σ_x·√(MTE/mc²); taking 0.9 µm/mm (MTE ≈ 0.41 eV) and σ_x = 0.2 mm gives 0.18 µm. At a 100 MV/m cathode field the surface-charge limit ε0E ≈ 8.85×10⁻⁴ C/m² allows at most about 0.45 nC from a 0.4 mm radius spot, so 200 pC uses 45% of it. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以法拉第杯或積分電流變壓器量電荷對雷射能量的曲線，線性段斜率即 QE，飽和處與鏡像電荷極限對照；以多種光斑尺寸量低電荷發射度，外推到零尺寸得 MTE；並定期以雷射掃描陰極面繪製 QE 分佈，追蹤局部劣化。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure charge versus laser energy with a Faraday cup or integrating current transformer: the linear slope is the QE and the saturation point is compared with the image-charge limit; measure low-charge emittance at several spot sizes and extrapolate to zero size to obtain the MTE; map QE across the cathode periodically with the laser to track local degradation.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"200 pC 等於 1.25×10⁹ 個電子，266 nm 光子能量 4.66 eV。Cs₂Te 的 QE = 1% 時雷射能量 1.25×10⁹/0.01×4.66 eV ≈ 93 nJ；銅陰極 QE = 5×10⁻⁵ 時需約 18.6 µJ。熱發射度 ε_th = σ_x·√(MTE/mc²)，取 0.9 µm/mm（MTE ≈ 0.41 eV）、σ_x = 0.2 mm 得 0.18 µm。陰極場 100 MV/m 的面電荷極限 ε₀E ≈ 8.85×10⁻⁴ C/m²，半徑 0.4 mm 的光斑最多約 0.45 nC，200 pC 已用掉 45%。","textEn":"200 pC is 1.25×10⁹ electrons, and a 266 nm photon carries 4.66 eV. With a Cs2Te QE of 1% the laser energy is 1.25×10⁹/0.01×4.66 eV ≈ 93 nJ; a copper cathode at QE = 5×10⁻⁵ needs about 18.6 µJ. Thermal emittance ε_th = σ_x·√(MTE/mc²); taking 0.9 µm/mm (MTE ≈ 0.41 eV) and σ_x = 0.2 mm gives 0.18 µm. At a 100 MV/m cathode field the surface-charge limit ε0E ≈ 8.85×10⁻⁴ C/m² allows at most about 0.45 nC from a 0.4 mm radius spot, so 200 pC uses 45% of it.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「光陰極射頻電子槍：量子效率、熱發射度與空間電荷」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Photocathode RF gun: quantum efficiency, thermal emittance and space charge\", which statement holds?","options":["射頻抖動只影響電子能量，不影響 X 光脈衝的到達時間。","200 pC 等於 1.25×10⁹ 個電子，266 nm 光子能量 4.66 eV。","偵測器上看到 X 光，就表示 FEL 已經飽和。"],"optionsEn":["RF jitter affects only electron energy, not the X-ray pulse arrival time.","200 pC is 1.25×10⁹ electrons, and a 266 nm photon carries 4.66 eV.","Seeing X-rays on the detector means the FEL has saturated."],"answer":1,"explanation":"200 pC 等於 1.25×10⁹ 個電子，266 nm 光子能量 4.66 eV。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"200 pC is 1.25×10⁹ electrons, and a 266 nm photon carries 4.66 eV. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a457-v12-11","title":"光陰極射頻電子槍：量子效率、熱發射度與空間電荷：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Photocathode RF gun: quantum efficiency, thermal emittance and space charge: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「光陰極與驅動雷射」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Photocathode and drive laser” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以法拉第杯或積分電流變壓器量電荷對雷射能量的曲線，線性段斜率即 QE，飽和處與鏡像電荷極限對照；以多種光斑尺寸量低電荷發射度，外推到零尺寸得 MTE；並定期以雷射掃描陰極面繪製 QE 分佈，追蹤局部劣化。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure charge versus laser energy with a Faraday cup or integrating current transformer: the linear slope is the QE and the saturation point is compared with the image-charge limit; measure low-charge emittance at several spot sizes and extrapolate to zero size to obtain the MTE; map QE across the cathode periodically with the laser to track local degradation. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：陰極在不良真空下被氧化或污染，QE 逐週下降，操作者只好不斷加大雷射能量；雷射熱點使局部 QE 不均，電子束橫向分佈出現熱點，發射度與暗電流同時上升。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A cathode oxidized or contaminated by poor vacuum loses QE week by week, so operators keep raising laser energy; laser hot spots make the local QE non-uniform, the electron beam's transverse profile develops hot spots, and emittance and dark current rise together.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以法拉第杯或積分電流變壓器量電荷對雷射能量的曲線，線性段斜率即 QE，飽和處與鏡像電荷極限對照；以多種光斑尺寸量低電荷發射度，外推到零尺寸得 MTE；並定期以雷射掃描陰極面繪製 QE 分佈，追蹤局部劣化。","textEn":"Measure charge versus laser energy with a Faraday cup or integrating current transformer: the linear slope is the QE and the saturation point is compared with the image-charge limit; measure low-charge emittance at several spot sizes and extrapolate to zero size to obtain the MTE; map QE across the cathode periodically with the laser to track local degradation.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「光陰極射頻電子槍：量子效率、熱發射度與空間電荷」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Photocathode RF gun: quantum efficiency, thermal emittance and space charge\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","FEL 的輸出波長由雷射介質決定，與電子能量無關。","以法拉第杯或積分電流變壓器量電荷對雷射能量的曲線，線性段斜率即 QE，飽和處與鏡像電荷極限對照。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","An FEL's output wavelength is set by a lasing medium and is independent of electron energy.","Measure charge versus laser energy with a Faraday cup or integrating current transformer: the linear slope is the QE and the saturation point is compared with the image-charge limit."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以法拉第杯或積分電流變壓器量電荷對雷射能量的曲線，線性段斜率即 QE，飽和處與鏡像電荷極限對照；以多種光斑尺寸量低電荷發射度，外推到零尺寸得 MTE；並定期以雷射掃描陰極面繪製 QE 分佈，追蹤局部劣化。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure charge versus laser energy with a Faraday cup or integrating current transformer: the linear slope is the QE and the saturation point is compared with the image-charge limit; measure low-charge emittance at several spot sizes and extrapolate to zero size to obtain the MTE; map QE across the cathode periodically with the laser to track local degradation. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a457-v12-12","title":"光陰極射頻電子槍：量子效率、熱發射度與空間電荷：失效診斷","titleEn":"Photocathode RF gun: quantum efficiency, thermal emittance and space charge: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「光陰極與驅動雷射」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Photocathode and drive laser” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"陰極在不良真空下被氧化或污染，QE 逐週下降，操作者只好不斷加大雷射能量；雷射熱點使局部 QE 不均，電子束橫向分佈出現熱點，發射度與暗電流同時上升。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A cathode oxidized or contaminated by poor vacuum loses QE week by week, so operators keep raising laser energy; laser hot spots make the local QE non-uniform, the electron beam's transverse profile develops hot spots, and emittance and dark current rise together. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：陰極表面約 100 MV/m 的射頻電場要快速把電子加速到相對論速度，以壓住空間電荷力；陰極面上的電荷面密度不能超過鏡像電荷極限 ε₀E，電子槍後的螺線管再做發射度補償，把各切片的橫向相空間重新對齊。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: An RF field of about 100 MV/m at the cathode must quickly accelerate electrons to relativistic speed to suppress space-charge forces; the surface charge density cannot exceed the image-charge limit ε0E, and a solenoid after the gun performs emittance compensation to realign the transverse phase space of the slices.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「電子槍之後的加速器可以降低正規化發射度，補回電子槍的不足。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The linac after the gun can reduce normalized emittance and make up for a poor gun.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"陰極在不良真空下被氧化或污染，QE 逐週下降，操作者只好不斷加大雷射能量；雷射熱點使局部 QE 不均，電子束橫向分佈出現熱點，發射度與暗電流同時上升。","textEn":"A cathode oxidized or contaminated by poor vacuum loses QE week by week, so operators keep raising laser energy; laser hot spots make the local QE non-uniform, the electron beam's transverse profile develops hot spots, and emittance and dark current rise together.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「光陰極射頻電子槍：量子效率、熱發射度與空間電荷」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Photocathode RF gun: quantum efficiency, thermal emittance and space charge\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["陰極在不良真空下被氧化或污染，QE 逐週下降，操作者只好不斷加大雷射能量；雷射熱點使局部 QE 不均，電子束橫向分佈出現熱點，發射度與暗電流同時上升。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","只要加速到夠高能量，束團長度就會自動變短。"],"optionsEn":["A cathode oxidized or contaminated by poor vacuum loses QE week by week, so operators keep raising laser energy.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Accelerating to high enough energy automatically shortens the bunch."],"answer":0,"explanation":"陰極在不良真空下被氧化或污染，QE 逐週下降，操作者只好不斷加大雷射能量；雷射熱點使局部 QE 不均，電子束橫向分佈出現熱點，發射度與暗電流同時上升。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A cathode oxidized or contaminated by poor vacuum loses QE week by week, so operators keep raising laser energy; laser hot spots make the local QE non-uniform, the electron beam's transverse profile develops hot spots, and emittance and dark current rise together. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a457-v12-13","title":"加速結構、射頻曲率線性化與磁束壓縮器：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Accelerating structures, RF-curvature linearization and chicanes: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「X 波段線性化腔與磁束壓縮器」如何決定自由電子雷射加速器的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “X-band linearizer and magnetic chicane” determines the key performance of “Free-electron-laser accelerators”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"束團壓縮先讓電子在離峰相位通過加速結構，建立頭低尾高的能量啁啾，再經四片偏轉磁鐵組成的磁束壓縮器，讓高能量電子走較短路徑追上前方。射頻電場是餘弦形，啁啾本身帶有二次曲率，壓縮後會把電流分佈扭成尖峰加長尾；在注入器後加一段頻率為主結構 4 倍的 X 波段結構，以減速相位運轉抵消曲率，使壓縮線性化。高梯度 C 波段結構孔徑小、短程尾場強，會在束團內產生額外能量變化，必須納入啁啾設計；壓縮器中的相干同步輻射則是發射度劣化的主要來源。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「X 波段線性化腔與磁束壓縮器」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Bunch compression first sends electrons off-crest through accelerating structures to build an energy chirp with the head lower and the tail higher, then through a four-dipole chicane where higher-energy electrons take a shorter path and catch up. Because the RF field is a cosine, the chirp carries a quadratic curvature that after compression twists the current profile into a spike with a long tail; an X-band section at four times the injector frequency, run at a decelerating phase after the injector, cancels the curvature and linearizes compression. High-gradient C-band structures have small irises and strong short-range wakefields that add energy variation within the bunch and must enter the chirp design, while coherent synchrotron radiation in the chicanes is the main source of emittance degradation. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “X-band linearizer and magnetic chicane”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：注入器 S 波段 V_s = 300 MV、離峰 20°，曲率項 ∝ V_s·cos φ·k_s²；以四倍頻 X 波段抵消需 V_x ≈ V_s·cos φ/n² = 300×0.94/16 ≈ 17.6 MV（減速），最終能量因此少約 17.6 MeV。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For an S-band injector with V_s = 300 MV at 20° off crest, the curvature term scales as V_s·cos φ·k_s²; cancelling it with a fourth-harmonic X-band section needs V_x ≈ V_s·cos φ/n² = 300×0.94/16 ≈ 17.6 MV at decelerating phase, costing about 17.6 MeV of final energy.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要加速到夠高能量，束團長度就會自動變短。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Accelerating to high enough energy automatically shortens the bunch.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「X 波段線性化腔與磁束壓縮器」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “X-band linearizer and magnetic chicane”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-13-k1","title":"加速結構、射頻曲率線性化與磁束壓縮器","titleEn":"Accelerating structures, RF-curvature linearization and chicanes","text":"束團壓縮先讓電子在離峰相位通過加速結構，建立頭低尾高的能量啁啾，再經四片偏轉磁鐵組成的磁束壓縮器，讓高能量電子走較短路徑追上前方。射頻電場是餘弦形，啁啾本身帶有二次曲率，壓縮後會把電流分佈扭成尖峰加長尾；在注入器後加一段頻率為主結構 4 倍的 X 波段結構，以減速相位運轉抵消曲率，使壓縮線性化。","textEn":"Bunch compression first sends electrons off-crest through accelerating structures to build an energy chirp with the head lower and the tail higher, then through a four-dipole chicane where higher-energy electrons take a shorter path and catch up. Because the RF field is a cosine, the chirp carries a quadratic curvature that after compression twists the current profile into a spike with a long tail; an X-band section at four times the injector frequency, run at a decelerating phase after the injector, cancels the curvature and linearizes compression.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要加速到夠高能量，束團長度就會自動變短。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Accelerating to high enough energy automatically shortens the bunch. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「加速結構、射頻曲率線性化與磁束壓縮器」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Accelerating structures, RF-curvature linearization and chicanes\" is correct?","options":["只要加速到夠高能量，束團長度就會自動變短。","束團壓縮先讓電子在離峰相位通過加速結構，建立頭低尾高的能量啁啾，再經四片偏轉磁鐵組成的磁束壓縮器，讓高能量電子走較短路徑追上前方。","屏上看到的垂直長度就是束團長度，不必扣除束流本身的尺寸。"],"optionsEn":["Accelerating to high enough energy automatically shortens the bunch.","Bunch compression first sends electrons off-crest through accelerating structures to build an energy chirp with the head lower and the tail higher, then through a four-dipole chicane where higher-energy electrons take a shorter path and catch up.","The vertical length on the screen equals the bunch length with no need to remove the beam's own size."],"answer":1,"explanation":"束團壓縮先讓電子在離峰相位通過加速結構，建立頭低尾高的能量啁啾，再經四片偏轉磁鐵組成的磁束壓縮器，讓高能量電子走較短路徑追上前方。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Bunch compression first sends electrons off-crest through accelerating structures to build an energy chirp with the head lower and the tail higher, then through a four-dipole chicane where higher-energy electrons take a shorter path and catch up. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a457-v12-14","title":"加速結構、射頻曲率線性化與磁束壓縮器：定量估算","titleEn":"Accelerating structures, RF-curvature linearization and chicanes: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「X 波段線性化腔與磁束壓縮器」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “X-band linearizer and magnetic chicane” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：注入器 S 波段 V_s = 300 MV、離峰 20°，曲率項 ∝ V_s·cos φ·k_s²；以四倍頻 X 波段抵消需 V_x ≈ V_s·cos φ/n² = 300×0.94/16 ≈ 17.6 MV（減速），最終能量因此少約 17.6 MeV。磁束壓縮器 R₅₆ ≈ −2θ²(ΔL + 2L_B/3)：θ = 0.0663 rad（3.8°）、L_B = 0.25 m、ΔL = 5 m 時 R₅₆ ≈ −2×0.0044×5.17 ≈ −45 mm。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For an S-band injector with V_s = 300 MV at 20° off crest, the curvature term scales as V_s·cos φ·k_s²; cancelling it with a fourth-harmonic X-band section needs V_x ≈ V_s·cos φ/n² = 300×0.94/16 ≈ 17.6 MV at decelerating phase, costing about 17.6 MeV of final energy. A chicane has R56 ≈ −2θ²(ΔL + 2L_B/3); with θ = 0.0663 rad (3.8°), L_B = 0.25 m and ΔL = 5 m, R56 ≈ −2×0.0044×5.17 ≈ −45 mm. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以橫向偏轉腔量壓縮前後的電流分佈，掃描 X 波段相位與振幅，找出電流分佈最對稱、尖峰最小的設定；把磁束壓縮器出口的相干輻射監測器訊號對射頻相位作圖，確認壓縮工作點；並以壓縮器前後的發射度量測估算 CSR 造成的劣化。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure the current profile before and after compression with a transverse deflector, scan X-band phase and amplitude to find the setting with the most symmetric profile and smallest spike, plot the signal of a coherent-radiation monitor at the chicane exit against RF phase to confirm the compression working point, and estimate CSR degradation from emittance measured before and after the chicane.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"注入器 S 波段 V_s = 300 MV、離峰 20°，曲率項 ∝ V_s·cos φ·k_s²；以四倍頻 X 波段抵消需 V_x ≈ V_s·cos φ/n² = 300×0.94/16 ≈ 17.6 MV（減速），最終能量因此少約 17.6 MeV。磁束壓縮器 R₅₆ ≈ −2θ²(ΔL + 2L_B/3)：θ = 0.0663 rad（3.8°）、L_B = 0.25 m、ΔL = 5 m 時 R₅₆ ≈ −2×0.0044×5.17 ≈ −45 mm。","textEn":"For an S-band injector with V_s = 300 MV at 20° off crest, the curvature term scales as V_s·cos φ·k_s²; cancelling it with a fourth-harmonic X-band section needs V_x ≈ V_s·cos φ/n² = 300×0.94/16 ≈ 17.6 MV at decelerating phase, costing about 17.6 MeV of final energy. A chicane has R56 ≈ −2θ²(ΔL + 2L_B/3); with θ = 0.0663 rad (3.8°), L_B = 0.25 m and ΔL = 5 m, R56 ≈ −2×0.0044×5.17 ≈ −45 mm.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「加速結構、射頻曲率線性化與磁束壓縮器」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Accelerating structures, RF-curvature linearization and chicanes\", which statement holds?","options":["波盪器只要磁場合格，電子軌道誤差影響不大。","FEL 的輸出波長由雷射介質決定，與電子能量無關。","注入器 S 波段 V_s = 300 MV、離峰 20°，曲率項 ∝ V_s·cos φ·k_s²。"],"optionsEn":["If the undulator field passes, electron orbit errors matter little.","An FEL's output wavelength is set by a lasing medium and is independent of electron energy.","For an S-band injector with V_s = 300 MV at 20° off crest, the curvature term scales as V_s·cos φ·k_s²."],"answer":2,"explanation":"注入器 S 波段 V_s = 300 MV、離峰 20°，曲率項 ∝ V_s·cos φ·k_s²；以四倍頻 X 波段抵消需 V_x ≈ V_s·cos φ/n² = 300×0.94/16 ≈ 17.6 MV（減速），最終能量因此少約 17.6 MeV。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For an S-band injector with V_s = 300 MV at 20° off crest, the curvature term scales as V_s·cos φ·k_s²; cancelling it with a fourth-harmonic X-band section needs V_x ≈ V_s·cos φ/n² = 300×0.94/16 ≈ 17.6 MV at decelerating phase, costing about 17.6 MeV of final energy. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a457-v12-15","title":"加速結構、射頻曲率線性化與磁束壓縮器：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Accelerating structures, RF-curvature linearization and chicanes: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「X 波段線性化腔與磁束壓縮器」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “X-band linearizer and magnetic chicane” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以橫向偏轉腔量壓縮前後的電流分佈，掃描 X 波段相位與振幅，找出電流分佈最對稱、尖峰最小的設定；把磁束壓縮器出口的相干輻射監測器訊號對射頻相位作圖，確認壓縮工作點；並以壓縮器前後的發射度量測估算 CSR 造成的劣化。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure the current profile before and after compression with a transverse deflector, scan X-band phase and amplitude to find the setting with the most symmetric profile and smallest spike, plot the signal of a coherent-radiation monitor at the chicane exit against RF phase to confirm the compression working point, and estimate CSR degradation from emittance measured before and after the chicane. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：X 波段線性化腔跳脫後未被察覺，壓縮後的電流出現數十 fs 的尖峰與長尾；尖峰處 CSR 使切片發射度惡化、脈衝能量下降，長尾則在波盪器中不貢獻增益，只增加輻射負載。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: An X-band linearizer trip that goes unnoticed leaves a compressed current with a spike tens of femtoseconds long and a long tail; CSR in the spike spoils slice emittance and lowers pulse energy, while the tail contributes no gain in the undulator and only adds radiation load.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以橫向偏轉腔量壓縮前後的電流分佈，掃描 X 波段相位與振幅，找出電流分佈最對稱、尖峰最小的設定；把磁束壓縮器出口的相干輻射監測器訊號對射頻相位作圖，確認壓縮工作點；並以壓縮器前後的發射度量測估算 CSR 造成的劣化。","textEn":"Measure the current profile before and after compression with a transverse deflector, scan X-band phase and amplitude to find the setting with the most symmetric profile and smallest spike, plot the signal of a coherent-radiation monitor at the chicane exit against RF phase to confirm the compression working point, and estimate CSR degradation from emittance measured before and after the chicane.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「加速結構、射頻曲率線性化與磁束壓縮器」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Accelerating structures, RF-curvature linearization and chicanes\"?","options":["以橫向偏轉腔量壓縮前後的電流分佈，掃描 X 波段相位與振幅，找出電流分佈最對稱、尖峰最小的設定。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","電子束能量散佈越小越好，降到零最理想。"],"optionsEn":["Measure the current profile before and after compression with a transverse deflector, scan X-band phase and amplitude to find the setting with the most symmetric profile and smallest spike, plot the signal of a coherent-radiation monitor at the chicane exit against RF phase to confirm the compression working point, and estimate CSR degradation from emittance measured before and after the chicane.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","The smaller the energy spread the better; zero would be ideal."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以橫向偏轉腔量壓縮前後的電流分佈，掃描 X 波段相位與振幅，找出電流分佈最對稱、尖峰最小的設定；把磁束壓縮器出口的相干輻射監測器訊號對射頻相位作圖，確認壓縮工作點；並以壓縮器前後的發射度量測估算 CSR 造成的劣化。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure the current profile before and after compression with a transverse deflector, scan X-band phase and amplitude to find the setting with the most symmetric profile and smallest spike, plot the signal of a coherent-radiation monitor at the chicane exit against RF phase to confirm the compression working point, and estimate CSR degradation from emittance measured before and after the chicane. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a457-v12-16","title":"加速結構、射頻曲率線性化與磁束壓縮器：失效診斷","titleEn":"Accelerating structures, RF-curvature linearization and chicanes: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「X 波段線性化腔與磁束壓縮器」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “X-band linearizer and magnetic chicane” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"X 波段線性化腔跳脫後未被察覺，壓縮後的電流出現數十 fs 的尖峰與長尾；尖峰處 CSR 使切片發射度惡化、脈衝能量下降，長尾則在波盪器中不貢獻增益，只增加輻射負載。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"An X-band linearizer trip that goes unnoticed leaves a compressed current with a spike tens of femtoseconds long and a long tail; CSR in the spike spoils slice emittance and lowers pulse energy, while the tail contributes no gain in the undulator and only adds radiation load. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：高梯度 C 波段結構孔徑小、短程尾場強，會在束團內產生額外能量變化，必須納入啁啾設計；壓縮器中的相干同步輻射則是發射度劣化的主要來源。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: High-gradient C-band structures have small irises and strong short-range wakefields that add energy variation within the bunch and must enter the chirp design, while coherent synchrotron radiation in the chicanes is the main source of emittance degradation.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要加速到夠高能量，束團長度就會自動變短。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Accelerating to high enough energy automatically shortens the bunch.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"X 波段線性化腔跳脫後未被察覺，壓縮後的電流出現數十 fs 的尖峰與長尾；尖峰處 CSR 使切片發射度惡化、脈衝能量下降，長尾則在波盪器中不貢獻增益，只增加輻射負載。","textEn":"An X-band linearizer trip that goes unnoticed leaves a compressed current with a spike tens of femtoseconds long and a long tail; CSR in the spike spoils slice emittance and lowers pulse energy, while the tail contributes no gain in the undulator and only adds radiation load.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「加速結構、射頻曲率線性化與磁束壓縮器」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Accelerating structures, RF-curvature linearization and chicanes\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","X 波段線性化腔跳脫後未被察覺，壓縮後的電流出現數十 fs 的尖峰與長尾。","屏上看到的垂直長度就是束團長度，不必扣除束流本身的尺寸。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","An X-band linearizer trip that goes unnoticed leaves a compressed current with a spike tens of femtoseconds long and a long tail.","The vertical length on the screen equals the bunch length with no need to remove the beam's own size."],"answer":1,"explanation":"X 波段線性化腔跳脫後未被察覺，壓縮後的電流出現數十 fs 的尖峰與長尾；尖峰處 CSR 使切片發射度惡化、脈衝能量下降，長尾則在波盪器中不貢獻增益，只增加輻射負載。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"An X-band linearizer trip that goes unnoticed leaves a compressed current with a spike tens of femtoseconds long and a long tail; CSR in the spike spoils slice emittance and lowers pulse energy, while the tail contributes no gain in the undulator and only adds radiation load. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a457-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「飛秒級縱向診斷：橫向偏轉腔」與「抖動預算：從射頻穩定度到峰值電流與到達時間」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Femtosecond longitudinal diagnostics: the transverse deflector\" and \"Jitter budget: from RF stability to peak current and arrival time\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a457-v12-17","title":"飛秒級縱向診斷：橫向偏轉腔：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Femtosecond longitudinal diagnostics: the transverse deflector: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「橫向偏轉腔與螢光屏」如何決定自由電子雷射加速器的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Transverse deflecting cavity and screen” determines the key performance of “Free-electron-laser accelerators”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"束團長度只有數十 fs，電子學無法直接量測。橫向偏轉腔以零交叉相位的橫向射頻場，讓束團頭尾得到方向相反的偏轉，把時間軸轉成螢光屏上的垂直位置；再配合水平偏轉的能譜儀，一張影像就能同時看到電流、切片能量散佈與能量啁啾。時間解析度受偏轉強度與電子束本身在屏上的垂直尺寸限制，偏轉腔也會增加切片能量散佈，因此量測設定本身要列入誤差分析。放在波盪器之後時，還能比較有無雷射作用時的切片能量損失，重建 X 光脈衝的時間形狀。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「橫向偏轉腔與螢光屏」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Bunches only tens of femtoseconds long cannot be measured directly with electronics. A transverse deflecting cavity applies a transverse RF field at zero crossing so head and tail are kicked in opposite directions, mapping time onto vertical position on a screen; combined with a horizontally bending spectrometer, one image shows current, slice energy spread and energy chirp together. Time resolution is limited by the kick strength and by the beam's own vertical size at the screen, and the deflector also adds slice energy spread, so the measurement setup belongs in the error analysis. Placed after the undulator, it compares slice energy loss with and without lasing to reconstruct the X-ray pulse's temporal shape. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Transverse deflecting cavity and screen”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：縱向剪切 S = eV·k·R₃₄/E：C 波段 f = 5.712 GHz（k = 119.7 m⁻¹）、V = 20 MV、R₃₄ = 20 m、E = 3 GeV 時 S ≈ 20×119.7×20/3000 ≈ 16，1 fs（0.30 µm）在屏上拉開 4.8 µm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The longitudinal shear S = eV·k·R34/E with C-band f = 5.712 GHz (k = 119.7 m⁻¹), V = 20 MV, R34 = 20 m and E = 3 GeV is S ≈ 20×119.7×20/3000 ≈ 16, so 1 fs (0.30 µm) spreads to 4.8 µm on the screen.","failure":"常見誤解：「屏上看到的垂直長度就是束團長度，不必扣除束流本身的尺寸。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The vertical length on the screen equals the bunch length with no need to remove the beam's own size.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「橫向偏轉腔與螢光屏」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Transverse deflecting cavity and screen”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-17-k1","title":"飛秒級縱向診斷：橫向偏轉腔","titleEn":"Femtosecond longitudinal diagnostics: the transverse deflector","text":"束團長度只有數十 fs，電子學無法直接量測。橫向偏轉腔以零交叉相位的橫向射頻場，讓束團頭尾得到方向相反的偏轉，把時間軸轉成螢光屏上的垂直位置；再配合水平偏轉的能譜儀，一張影像就能同時看到電流、切片能量散佈與能量啁啾。","textEn":"Bunches only tens of femtoseconds long cannot be measured directly with electronics. A transverse deflecting cavity applies a transverse RF field at zero crossing so head and tail are kicked in opposite directions, mapping time onto vertical position on a screen; combined with a horizontally bending spectrometer, one image shows current, slice energy spread and energy chirp together.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：屏上看到的垂直長度就是束團長度，不必扣除束流本身的尺寸。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The vertical length on the screen equals the bunch length with no need to remove the beam's own size. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「飛秒級縱向診斷：橫向偏轉腔」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Femtosecond longitudinal diagnostics: the transverse deflector\" is correct?","options":["屏上看到的垂直長度就是束團長度，不必扣除束流本身的尺寸。","射頻抖動只影響電子能量，不影響 X 光脈衝的到達時間。","束團長度只有數十 fs，電子學無法直接量測。"],"optionsEn":["The vertical length on the screen equals the bunch length with no need to remove the beam's own size.","RF jitter affects only electron energy, not the X-ray pulse arrival time.","Bunches only tens of femtoseconds long cannot be measured directly with electronics."],"answer":2,"explanation":"束團長度只有數十 fs，電子學無法直接量測。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Bunches only tens of femtoseconds long cannot be measured directly with electronics. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a457-v12-18","title":"飛秒級縱向診斷：橫向偏轉腔：定量估算","titleEn":"Femtosecond longitudinal diagnostics: the transverse deflector: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「橫向偏轉腔與螢光屏」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Transverse deflecting cavity and screen” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：縱向剪切 S = eV·k·R₃₄/E：C 波段 f = 5.712 GHz（k = 119.7 m⁻¹）、V = 20 MV、R₃₄ = 20 m、E = 3 GeV 時 S ≈ 20×119.7×20/3000 ≈ 16，1 fs（0.30 µm）在屏上拉開 4.8 µm。若關閉偏轉腔時屏上垂直尺寸 σ_y0 = 50 µm，時間解析度 ≈ 50/4.8 ≈ 10.4 fs；要達到 5 fs，需把電壓或 R₃₄ 加倍，或把 σ_y0 降到 24 µm。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The longitudinal shear S = eV·k·R34/E with C-band f = 5.712 GHz (k = 119.7 m⁻¹), V = 20 MV, R34 = 20 m and E = 3 GeV is S ≈ 20×119.7×20/3000 ≈ 16, so 1 fs (0.30 µm) spreads to 4.8 µm on the screen. With a vertical size σ_y0 = 50 µm at the screen when the deflector is off, the time resolution ≈ 50/4.8 ≈ 10.4 fs; reaching 5 fs requires doubling the voltage or R34, or cutting σ_y0 to 24 µm. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以偏轉腔相位做小幅掃描，取屏上束流質心位移對相位的斜率作為時間標定（µm/fs）；在兩個零交叉（+90° 與 −90°）各量一次，以消除束團內原有的 y–z 相關；關閉偏轉腔量 σ_y0 確認解析度，並以相干輻射監測器的訊號趨勢交叉檢查壓縮量。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Calibrate the time axis by scanning the deflector phase slightly and taking the slope of centroid displacement versus phase (µm per fs); measure at both zero crossings, +90° and −90°, to cancel any intrinsic y–z correlation in the bunch; measure σ_y0 with the deflector off to confirm resolution, and cross-check compression against the coherent-radiation monitor trend.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"縱向剪切 S = eV·k·R₃₄/E：C 波段 f = 5.712 GHz（k = 119.7 m⁻¹）、V = 20 MV、R₃₄ = 20 m、E = 3 GeV 時 S ≈ 20×119.7×20/3000 ≈ 16，1 fs（0.30 µm）在屏上拉開 4.8 µm。若關閉偏轉腔時屏上垂直尺寸 σ_y0 = 50 µm，時間解析度 ≈ 50/4.8 ≈ 10.4 fs；要達到 5 fs，需把電壓或 R₃₄ 加倍，或把 σ_y0 降到 24 µm。","textEn":"The longitudinal shear S = eV·k·R34/E with C-band f = 5.712 GHz (k = 119.7 m⁻¹), V = 20 MV, R34 = 20 m and E = 3 GeV is S ≈ 20×119.7×20/3000 ≈ 16, so 1 fs (0.30 µm) spreads to 4.8 µm on the screen. With a vertical size σ_y0 = 50 µm at the screen when the deflector is off, the time resolution ≈ 50/4.8 ≈ 10.4 fs; reaching 5 fs requires doubling the voltage or R34, or cutting σ_y0 to 24 µm.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「飛秒級縱向診斷：橫向偏轉腔」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Femtosecond longitudinal diagnostics: the transverse deflector\", which statement holds?","options":["縱向剪切 S = eV·k·R₃₄/E：C 波段 f = 5.712 GHz（k = 119.7 m⁻¹）、V = 20 MV、R₃₄ = 20 m、E = 3 GeV 時 S ≈ 20×119.7×20/3000 ≈ 16，1 fs（0.30 µm）在屏上拉開 4.8 µm。","偵測器上看到 X 光，就表示 FEL 已經飽和。","電子束能量散佈越小越好，降到零最理想。"],"optionsEn":["The longitudinal shear S = eV·k·R34/E with C-band f = 5.712 GHz (k = 119.7 m⁻¹), V = 20 MV, R34 = 20 m and E = 3 GeV is S ≈ 20×119.7×20/3000 ≈ 16, so 1 fs (0.30 µm) spreads to 4.8 µm on the screen.","Seeing X-rays on the detector means the FEL has saturated.","The smaller the energy spread the better; zero would be ideal."],"answer":0,"explanation":"縱向剪切 S = eV·k·R₃₄/E：C 波段 f = 5.712 GHz（k = 119.7 m⁻¹）、V = 20 MV、R₃₄ = 20 m、E = 3 GeV 時 S ≈ 20×119.7×20/3000 ≈ 16，1 fs（0.30 µm）在屏上拉開 4.8 µm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The longitudinal shear S = eV·k·R34/E with C-band f = 5.712 GHz (k = 119.7 m⁻¹), V = 20 MV, R34 = 20 m and E = 3 GeV is S ≈ 20×119.7×20/3000 ≈ 16, so 1 fs (0.30 µm) spreads to 4.8 µm on the screen. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a457-v12-19","title":"飛秒級縱向診斷：橫向偏轉腔：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Femtosecond longitudinal diagnostics: the transverse deflector: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「橫向偏轉腔與螢光屏」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Transverse deflecting cavity and screen” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以偏轉腔相位做小幅掃描，取屏上束流質心位移對相位的斜率作為時間標定（µm/fs）；在兩個零交叉（+90° 與 −90°）各量一次，以消除束團內原有的 y–z 相關；關閉偏轉腔量 σ_y0 確認解析度，並以相干輻射監測器的訊號趨勢交叉檢查壓縮量。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Calibrate the time axis by scanning the deflector phase slightly and taking the slope of centroid displacement versus phase (µm per fs); measure at both zero crossings, +90° and −90°, to cancel any intrinsic y–z correlation in the bunch; measure σ_y0 with the deflector off to confirm resolution, and cross-check compression against the coherent-radiation monitor trend. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：只在單一零交叉量測，束團原有的 y–z 傾斜被誤當成束長，回報的電流偏高或偏低 30%；據此調整壓縮器後，實際峰值電流偏離設計，增益長度變長，飽和點移出波盪器末端。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Measuring at only one zero crossing mistakes an intrinsic y–z tilt for bunch length, reporting current 30% high or low; tuning the compressors on that basis leaves the real peak current off design, lengthens the gain length and moves saturation past the end of the undulator.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以偏轉腔相位做小幅掃描，取屏上束流質心位移對相位的斜率作為時間標定（µm/fs）；在兩個零交叉（+90° 與 −90°）各量一次，以消除束團內原有的 y–z 相關；關閉偏轉腔量 σ_y0 確認解析度，並以相干輻射監測器的訊號趨勢交叉檢查壓縮量。","textEn":"Calibrate the time axis by scanning the deflector phase slightly and taking the slope of centroid displacement versus phase (µm per fs); measure at both zero crossings, +90° and −90°, to cancel any intrinsic y–z correlation in the bunch; measure σ_y0 with the deflector off to confirm resolution, and cross-check compression against the coherent-radiation monitor trend.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「飛秒級縱向診斷：橫向偏轉腔」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Femtosecond longitudinal diagnostics: the transverse deflector\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","以偏轉腔相位做小幅掃描，取屏上束流質心位移對相位的斜率作為時間標定（µm/fs）。","電子槍之後的加速器可以降低正規化發射度，補回電子槍的不足。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Calibrate the time axis by scanning the deflector phase slightly and taking the slope of centroid displacement versus phase (µm per fs).","The linac after the gun can reduce normalized emittance and make up for a poor gun."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以偏轉腔相位做小幅掃描，取屏上束流質心位移對相位的斜率作為時間標定（µm/fs）；在兩個零交叉（+90° 與 −90°）各量一次，以消除束團內原有的 y–z 相關；關閉偏轉腔量 σ_y0 確認解析度，並以相干輻射監測器的訊號趨勢交叉檢查壓縮量。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Calibrate the time axis by scanning the deflector phase slightly and taking the slope of centroid displacement versus phase (µm per fs); measure at both zero crossings, +90° and −90°, to cancel any intrinsic y–z correlation in the bunch; measure σ_y0 with the deflector off to confirm resolution, and cross-check compression against the coherent-radiation monitor trend. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a457-v12-20","title":"飛秒級縱向診斷：橫向偏轉腔：失效診斷","titleEn":"Femtosecond longitudinal diagnostics: the transverse deflector: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「橫向偏轉腔與螢光屏」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Transverse deflecting cavity and screen” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"只在單一零交叉量測，束團原有的 y–z 傾斜被誤當成束長，回報的電流偏高或偏低 30%；據此調整壓縮器後，實際峰值電流偏離設計，增益長度變長，飽和點移出波盪器末端。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Measuring at only one zero crossing mistakes an intrinsic y–z tilt for bunch length, reporting current 30% high or low; tuning the compressors on that basis leaves the real peak current off design, lengthens the gain length and moves saturation past the end of the undulator. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：放在波盪器之後時，還能比較有無雷射作用時的切片能量損失，重建 X 光脈衝的時間形狀。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Placed after the undulator, it compares slice energy loss with and without lasing to reconstruct the X-ray pulse's temporal shape.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「屏上看到的垂直長度就是束團長度，不必扣除束流本身的尺寸。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The vertical length on the screen equals the bunch length with no need to remove the beam's own size.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只在單一零交叉量測，束團原有的 y–z 傾斜被誤當成束長，回報的電流偏高或偏低 30%；據此調整壓縮器後，實際峰值電流偏離設計，增益長度變長，飽和點移出波盪器末端。","textEn":"Measuring at only one zero crossing mistakes an intrinsic y–z tilt for bunch length, reporting current 30% high or low; tuning the compressors on that basis leaves the real peak current off design, lengthens the gain length and moves saturation past the end of the undulator.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「飛秒級縱向診斷：橫向偏轉腔」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Femtosecond longitudinal diagnostics: the transverse deflector\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","射頻抖動只影響電子能量，不影響 X 光脈衝的到達時間。","只在單一零交叉量測，束團原有的 y–z 傾斜被誤當成束長，回報的電流偏高或偏低 30%。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","RF jitter affects only electron energy, not the X-ray pulse arrival time.","Measuring at only one zero crossing mistakes an intrinsic y–z tilt for bunch length, reporting current 30% high or low."],"answer":2,"explanation":"只在單一零交叉量測，束團原有的 y–z 傾斜被誤當成束長，回報的電流偏高或偏低 30%；據此調整壓縮器後，實際峰值電流偏離設計，增益長度變長，飽和點移出波盪器末端。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Measuring at only one zero crossing mistakes an intrinsic y–z tilt for bunch length, reporting current 30% high or low; tuning the compressors on that basis leaves the real peak current off design, lengthens the gain length and moves saturation past the end of the undulator. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a457-v12-21","title":"抖動預算：從射頻穩定度到峰值電流與到達時間：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Jitter budget: from RF stability to peak current and arrival time: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「射頻相位與振幅抖動預算」如何決定自由電子雷射加速器的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “RF phase and amplitude jitter budget” determines the key performance of “Free-electron-laser accelerators”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"加速器每一段的射頻相位與振幅抖動，都會透過壓縮器轉換成束流參數的逐發變動：相位抖動改變啁啾，使壓縮因子與峰值電流抖動，進而改變增益長度與脈衝能量；振幅抖動造成能量偏差，經 R₅₆ 轉成到達時間偏移，並在最終能量上轉成光子波長抖動。壓縮因子在高壓縮時對啁啾非常敏感，因此第一級壓縮器之前的射頻穩定度要求最嚴，常需 0.02° 與 10⁻⁴ 等級，由低階射頻控制與光纖時序分配系統共同達成。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「射頻相位與振幅抖動預算」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Phase and amplitude jitter in every RF section becomes shot-to-shot variation of beam parameters through the compressors: phase jitter alters the chirp, so compression factor and peak current fluctuate, changing gain length and pulse energy; amplitude jitter produces energy deviation that R56 converts into arrival-time offset and, at the final energy, into photon-wavelength jitter. Because the compression factor is very sensitive to chirp at strong compression, RF stability before the first compressor is the most demanding, often at the 0.02° and 10⁻⁴ level, achieved jointly by low-level RF control and an optical-fibre timing distribution system. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “RF phase and amplitude jitter budget”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：第一級壓縮 C = 1/(1 + hR₅₆) = 10，即 hR₅₆ = −0.9；啁啾 h ∝ sin φ，離峰 20° 時相位抖動 0.02°（3.49×10⁻⁴ rad）使 dh/h = cot 20°×3.49×10⁻⁴ ≈ 9.6×10⁻⁴，壓縮因子變動 dC/C ≈ C·|hR₅₆|·dh/h ≈ 10×0.9×9.6×10⁻⁴ ≈ 0.86%。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For a first-stage compression C = 1/(1 + hR56) = 10, hR56 = −0.9; the chirp h ∝ sin φ, so at 20° off crest a phase jitter of 0.02° (3.49×10⁻⁴ rad) gives dh/h = cot 20°×3.49×10⁻⁴ ≈ 9.6×10⁻⁴ and a compression change dC/C ≈ C·|hR56|·dh/h ≈ 10×0.9×9.6×10⁻⁴ ≈ 0.86%.","failure":"常見誤解：「射頻抖動只影響電子能量，不影響 X 光脈衝的到達時間。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"RF jitter affects only electron energy, not the X-ray pulse arrival time.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「射頻相位與振幅抖動預算」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “RF phase and amplitude jitter budget”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-21-k1","title":"抖動預算：從射頻穩定度到峰值電流與到達時間","titleEn":"Jitter budget: from RF stability to peak current and arrival time","text":"加速器每一段的射頻相位與振幅抖動，都會透過壓縮器轉換成束流參數的逐發變動：相位抖動改變啁啾，使壓縮因子與峰值電流抖動，進而改變增益長度與脈衝能量；振幅抖動造成能量偏差，經 R₅₆ 轉成到達時間偏移，並在最終能量上轉成光子波長抖動。壓縮因子在高壓縮時對啁啾非常敏感，因此第一級壓縮器之前的射頻穩定度要求最嚴，常需 0.02° 與 10⁻⁴ 等級，由低階射頻控制與光纖時序分配系統共同達成。","textEn":"Phase and amplitude jitter in every RF section becomes shot-to-shot variation of beam parameters through the compressors: phase jitter alters the chirp, so compression factor and peak current fluctuate, changing gain length and pulse energy; amplitude jitter produces energy deviation that R56 converts into arrival-time offset and, at the final energy, into photon-wavelength jitter. Because the compression factor is very sensitive to chirp at strong compression, RF stability before the first compressor is the most demanding, often at the 0.02° and 10⁻⁴ level, achieved jointly by low-level RF control and an optical-fibre timing distribution system.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：射頻抖動只影響電子能量，不影響 X 光脈衝的到達時間。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: RF jitter affects only electron energy, not the X-ray pulse arrival time. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「抖動預算：從射頻穩定度到峰值電流與到達時間」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Jitter budget: from RF stability to peak current and arrival time\" is correct?","options":["加速器每一段的射頻相位與振幅抖動，都會透過壓縮器轉換成束流參數的逐發變動：相位抖動改變啁啾，使壓縮因子與峰值電流抖動，進而改變增益長度與脈衝能量。","射頻抖動只影響電子能量，不影響 X 光脈衝的到達時間。","波盪器只要磁場合格，電子軌道誤差影響不大。"],"optionsEn":["Phase and amplitude jitter in every RF section becomes shot-to-shot variation of beam parameters through the compressors: phase jitter alters the chirp, so compression factor and peak current fluctuate, changing gain length and pulse energy.","RF jitter affects only electron energy, not the X-ray pulse arrival time.","If the undulator field passes, electron orbit errors matter little."],"answer":0,"explanation":"加速器每一段的射頻相位與振幅抖動，都會透過壓縮器轉換成束流參數的逐發變動：相位抖動改變啁啾，使壓縮因子與峰值電流抖動，進而改變增益長度與脈衝能量；振幅抖動造成能量偏差，經 R₅₆ 轉成到達時間偏移，並在最終能量上轉成光子波長抖動。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Phase and amplitude jitter in every RF section becomes shot-to-shot variation of beam parameters through the compressors: phase jitter alters the chirp, so compression factor and peak current fluctuate, changing gain length and pulse energy; amplitude jitter produces energy deviation that R56 converts into arrival-time offset and, at the final energy, into photon-wavelength jitter. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a457-v12-22","title":"抖動預算：從射頻穩定度到峰值電流與到達時間：定量估算","titleEn":"Jitter budget: from RF stability to peak current and arrival time: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「射頻相位與振幅抖動預算」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “RF phase and amplitude jitter budget” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：第一級壓縮 C = 1/(1 + hR₅₆) = 10，即 hR₅₆ = −0.9；啁啾 h ∝ sin φ，離峰 20° 時相位抖動 0.02°（3.49×10⁻⁴ rad）使 dh/h = cot 20°×3.49×10⁻⁴ ≈ 9.6×10⁻⁴，壓縮因子變動 dC/C ≈ C·|hR₅₆|·dh/h ≈ 10×0.9×9.6×10⁻⁴ ≈ 0.86%。振幅抖動 10⁻⁴ 造成 δ = 10⁻⁴，經 R₅₆ = 45 mm 得 Δz = 4.5 µm，到達時間偏移約 15 fs。最終能量抖動 2×10⁻⁴ 使 12.4 keV 光子偏移約 5 eV。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For a first-stage compression C = 1/(1 + hR56) = 10, hR56 = −0.9; the chirp h ∝ sin φ, so at 20° off crest a phase jitter of 0.02° (3.49×10⁻⁴ rad) gives dh/h = cot 20°×3.49×10⁻⁴ ≈ 9.6×10⁻⁴ and a compression change dC/C ≈ C·|hR56|·dh/h ≈ 10×0.9×9.6×10⁻⁴ ≈ 0.86%. Amplitude jitter of 10⁻⁴ gives δ = 10⁻⁴, which R56 = 45 mm turns into Δz = 4.5 µm, an arrival-time offset of about 15 fs. A final energy jitter of 2×10⁻⁴ shifts 12.4 keV photons by about 5 eV. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：逐發記錄各射頻站的相位與振幅、各壓縮器後的相干輻射監測器訊號、到達時間監測器與能量 BPM，計算變數之間的相關係數與靈敏度矩陣；以刻意小幅改變單一站相位的方式驗證靈敏度，並把量到的抖動依預算表分配給各站。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Log shot by shot the phase and amplitude of every RF station, the coherent-radiation monitor after each compressor, the bunch-arrival-time monitor and an energy BPM; compute correlation coefficients and a sensitivity matrix between them, verify each sensitivity by deliberately stepping one station's phase slightly, and allocate the measured jitter to stations according to the budget table.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"第一級壓縮 C = 1/(1 + hR₅₆) = 10，即 hR₅₆ = −0.9；啁啾 h ∝ sin φ，離峰 20° 時相位抖動 0.02°（3.49×10⁻⁴ rad）使 dh/h = cot 20°×3.49×10⁻⁴ ≈ 9.6×10⁻⁴，壓縮因子變動 dC/C ≈ C·|hR₅₆|·dh/h ≈ 10×0.9×9.6×10⁻⁴ ≈ 0.86%。振幅抖動 10⁻⁴ 造成 δ = 10⁻⁴，經 R₅₆ = 45 mm 得 Δz = 4.5 µm，到達時間偏移約 15 fs。最終能量抖動 2×10⁻⁴ 使 12.4 keV 光子偏移約 5 eV。","textEn":"For a first-stage compression C = 1/(1 + hR56) = 10, hR56 = −0.9; the chirp h ∝ sin φ, so at 20° off crest a phase jitter of 0.02° (3.49×10⁻⁴ rad) gives dh/h = cot 20°×3.49×10⁻⁴ ≈ 9.6×10⁻⁴ and a compression change dC/C ≈ C·|hR56|·dh/h ≈ 10×0.9×9.6×10⁻⁴ ≈ 0.86%. Amplitude jitter of 10⁻⁴ gives δ = 10⁻⁴, which R56 = 45 mm turns into Δz = 4.5 µm, an arrival-time offset of about 15 fs. A final energy jitter of 2×10⁻⁴ shifts 12.4 keV photons by about 5 eV.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「抖動預算：從射頻穩定度到峰值電流與到達時間」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Jitter budget: from RF stability to peak current and arrival time\", which statement holds?","options":["FEL 的輸出波長由雷射介質決定，與電子能量無關。","第一級壓縮 C = 1/(1 + hR₅₆) = 10，即 hR₅₆ = −0.9。","電子槍之後的加速器可以降低正規化發射度，補回電子槍的不足。"],"optionsEn":["An FEL's output wavelength is set by a lasing medium and is independent of electron energy.","For a first-stage compression C = 1/(1 + hR56) = 10, hR56 = −0.9.","The linac after the gun can reduce normalized emittance and make up for a poor gun."],"answer":1,"explanation":"第一級壓縮 C = 1/(1 + hR₅₆) = 10，即 hR₅₆ = −0.9；啁啾 h ∝ sin φ，離峰 20° 時相位抖動 0.02°（3.49×10⁻⁴ rad）使 dh/h = cot 20°×3.49×10⁻⁴ ≈ 9.6×10⁻⁴，壓縮因子變動 dC/C ≈ C·|hR₅₆|·dh/h ≈ 10×0.9×9.6×10⁻⁴ ≈ 0.86%。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For a first-stage compression C = 1/(1 + hR56) = 10, hR56 = −0.9; the chirp h ∝ sin φ, so at 20° off crest a phase jitter of 0.02° (3.49×10⁻⁴ rad) gives dh/h = cot 20°×3.49×10⁻⁴ ≈ 9.6×10⁻⁴ and a compression change dC/C ≈ C·|hR56|·dh/h ≈ 10×0.9×9.6×10⁻⁴ ≈ 0.86%. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a457-v12-23","title":"抖動預算：從射頻穩定度到峰值電流與到達時間：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Jitter budget: from RF stability to peak current and arrival time: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「射頻相位與振幅抖動預算」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “RF phase and amplitude jitter budget” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"逐發記錄各射頻站的相位與振幅、各壓縮器後的相干輻射監測器訊號、到達時間監測器與能量 BPM，計算變數之間的相關係數與靈敏度矩陣；以刻意小幅改變單一站相位的方式驗證靈敏度，並把量到的抖動依預算表分配給各站。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Log shot by shot the phase and amplitude of every RF station, the coherent-radiation monitor after each compressor, the bunch-arrival-time monitor and an energy BPM; compute correlation coefficients and a sensitivity matrix between them, verify each sensitivity by deliberately stepping one station's phase slightly, and allocate the measured jitter to stations according to the budget table. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：某一速調管調變器的高壓漣波增加，相位抖動從 0.02° 升到 0.1°，峰值電流抖動放大到約 4%，X 光脈衝能量的逐發起伏變大且與電流高度相關；若只看平均脈衝能量，問題會被誤判為波盪器失準。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Increased high-voltage ripple in one klystron modulator raises phase jitter from 0.02° to 0.1°, amplifying peak-current jitter to about 4%; X-ray pulse-energy fluctuation grows and correlates strongly with current, and looking only at average pulse energy misdiagnoses the problem as undulator misalignment.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"逐發記錄各射頻站的相位與振幅、各壓縮器後的相干輻射監測器訊號、到達時間監測器與能量 BPM，計算變數之間的相關係數與靈敏度矩陣；以刻意小幅改變單一站相位的方式驗證靈敏度，並把量到的抖動依預算表分配給各站。","textEn":"Log shot by shot the phase and amplitude of every RF station, the coherent-radiation monitor after each compressor, the bunch-arrival-time monitor and an energy BPM; compute correlation coefficients and a sensitivity matrix between them, verify each sensitivity by deliberately stepping one station's phase slightly, and allocate the measured jitter to stations according to the budget table.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「抖動預算：從射頻穩定度到峰值電流與到達時間」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Jitter budget: from RF stability to peak current and arrival time\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","只要加速到夠高能量，束團長度就會自動變短。","逐發記錄各射頻站的相位與振幅、各壓縮器後的相干輻射監測器訊號、到達時間監測器與能量 BPM，計算變數之間的相關係數與靈敏度矩陣。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","Accelerating to high enough energy automatically shortens the bunch.","Log shot by shot the phase and amplitude of every RF station, the coherent-radiation monitor after each compressor, the bunch-arrival-time monitor and an energy BPM."],"answer":2,"explanation":"逐發記錄各射頻站的相位與振幅、各壓縮器後的相干輻射監測器訊號、到達時間監測器與能量 BPM，計算變數之間的相關係數與靈敏度矩陣；以刻意小幅改變單一站相位的方式驗證靈敏度，並把量到的抖動依預算表分配給各站。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Log shot by shot the phase and amplitude of every RF station, the coherent-radiation monitor after each compressor, the bunch-arrival-time monitor and an energy BPM; compute correlation coefficients and a sensitivity matrix between them, verify each sensitivity by deliberately stepping one station's phase slightly, and allocate the measured jitter to stations according to the budget table. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a457-v12-24","title":"抖動預算：從射頻穩定度到峰值電流與到達時間：失效診斷","titleEn":"Jitter budget: from RF stability to peak current and arrival time: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「射頻相位與振幅抖動預算」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “RF phase and amplitude jitter budget” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"某一速調管調變器的高壓漣波增加，相位抖動從 0.02° 升到 0.1°，峰值電流抖動放大到約 4%，X 光脈衝能量的逐發起伏變大且與電流高度相關；若只看平均脈衝能量，問題會被誤判為波盪器失準。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Increased high-voltage ripple in one klystron modulator raises phase jitter from 0.02° to 0.1°, amplifying peak-current jitter to about 4%; X-ray pulse-energy fluctuation grows and correlates strongly with current, and looking only at average pulse energy misdiagnoses the problem as undulator misalignment. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：壓縮因子在高壓縮時對啁啾非常敏感，因此第一級壓縮器之前的射頻穩定度要求最嚴，常需 0.02° 與 10⁻⁴ 等級，由低階射頻控制與光纖時序分配系統共同達成。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Because the compression factor is very sensitive to chirp at strong compression, RF stability before the first compressor is the most demanding, often at the 0.02° and 10⁻⁴ level, achieved jointly by low-level RF control and an optical-fibre timing distribution system.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「射頻抖動只影響電子能量，不影響 X 光脈衝的到達時間。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"RF jitter affects only electron energy, not the X-ray pulse arrival time.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"某一速調管調變器的高壓漣波增加，相位抖動從 0.02° 升到 0.1°，峰值電流抖動放大到約 4%，X 光脈衝能量的逐發起伏變大且與電流高度相關；若只看平均脈衝能量，問題會被誤判為波盪器失準。","textEn":"Increased high-voltage ripple in one klystron modulator raises phase jitter from 0.02° to 0.1°, amplifying peak-current jitter to about 4%; X-ray pulse-energy fluctuation grows and correlates strongly with current, and looking only at average pulse energy misdiagnoses the problem as undulator misalignment.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「抖動預算：從射頻穩定度到峰值電流與到達時間」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Jitter budget: from RF stability to peak current and arrival time\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["某一速調管調變器的高壓漣波增加，相位抖動從 0.02° 升到 0.1°，峰值電流抖動放大到約 4%，X 光脈衝能量的逐發起伏變大且與電流高度相關。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","波盪器只要磁場合格，電子軌道誤差影響不大。"],"optionsEn":["Increased high-voltage ripple in one klystron modulator raises phase jitter from 0.02° to 0.1°, amplifying peak-current jitter to about 4%.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","If the undulator field passes, electron orbit errors matter little."],"answer":0,"explanation":"某一速調管調變器的高壓漣波增加，相位抖動從 0.02° 升到 0.1°，峰值電流抖動放大到約 4%，X 光脈衝能量的逐發起伏變大且與電流高度相關；若只看平均脈衝能量，問題會被誤判為波盪器失準。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Increased high-voltage ripple in one klystron modulator raises phase jitter from 0.02° to 0.1°, amplifying peak-current jitter to about 4%; X-ray pulse-energy fluctuation grows and correlates strongly with current, and looking only at average pulse energy misdiagnoses the problem as undulator misalignment. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a457-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「波盪器線整合：軌道直線度、相位匹配與種子化」與「增益曲線、飽和脈衝能量與試運轉交接」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Undulator-line integration: trajectory straightness, phase matching and seeding\" and \"Gain curve, saturation pulse energy and commissioning handoff\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a457-v12-25","title":"波盪器線整合：軌道直線度、相位匹配與種子化：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Undulator-line integration: trajectory straightness, phase matching and seeding: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「波盪器線與自種子晶體」如何決定自由電子雷射加速器的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Undulator line and self-seeding crystal” determines the key performance of “Free-electron-laser accelerators”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"波盪器由數十段 4 到 5 m 的模組組成，段間以四極聚焦、相位器與 BPM 銜接。電子軌道只要有微小角度偏差，路徑就比直線長，與光的相對相位滑移，使微束團與輻射失去同步；因此整條波盪器線要以束流基準對準，把軌道直線度做到每數公尺數微米。SASE 從雜訊起始，頻譜呈尖刺狀；硬 X 光自種子在中段插入鑽石晶體，以前半段 SASE 光經布拉格反射後的尾波作為窄頻種子，後半段只放大種子，使頻寬與穩定度大幅改善。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「波盪器線與自種子晶體」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The undulator consists of tens of 4 to 5 m modules joined by quadrupoles, phase shifters and BPMs. Any small angular deviation lengthens the electron path relative to a straight line and slips its phase relative to the light, desynchronizing microbunches and radiation, so the whole line needs beam-based alignment to a straightness of a few micrometres over several metres. SASE starts from noise and has a spiky spectrum; hard X-ray self-seeding inserts a diamond crystal mid-line where the Bragg-reflected wake of the first half's SASE light serves as a narrow-band seed, and the second half amplifies only the seed, greatly improving bandwidth and stability. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Undulator line and self-seeding crystal”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：軌道角度 x' 使電子比直線多走 Δs = ½∫x'²ds。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: An orbit angle x' makes the electron travel Δs = ½∫x'²ds more than a straight path.","failure":"常見誤解：「波盪器只要磁場合格，電子軌道誤差影響不大。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"If the undulator field passes, electron orbit errors matter little.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「波盪器線與自種子晶體」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Undulator line and self-seeding crystal”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-25-k1","title":"波盪器線整合：軌道直線度、相位匹配與種子化","titleEn":"Undulator-line integration: trajectory straightness, phase matching and seeding","text":"波盪器由數十段 4 到 5 m 的模組組成，段間以四極聚焦、相位器與 BPM 銜接。電子軌道只要有微小角度偏差，路徑就比直線長，與光的相對相位滑移，使微束團與輻射失去同步；因此整條波盪器線要以束流基準對準，把軌道直線度做到每數公尺數微米。","textEn":"The undulator consists of tens of 4 to 5 m modules joined by quadrupoles, phase shifters and BPMs. Any small angular deviation lengthens the electron path relative to a straight line and slips its phase relative to the light, desynchronizing microbunches and radiation, so the whole line needs beam-based alignment to a straightness of a few micrometres over several metres.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：波盪器只要磁場合格，電子軌道誤差影響不大。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: If the undulator field passes, electron orbit errors matter little. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「波盪器線整合：軌道直線度、相位匹配與種子化」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Undulator-line integration: trajectory straightness, phase matching and seeding\" is correct?","options":["波盪器只要磁場合格，電子軌道誤差影響不大。","波盪器由數十段 4 到 5 m 的模組組成，段間以四極聚焦、相位器與 BPM 銜接。","偵測器上看到 X 光，就表示 FEL 已經飽和。"],"optionsEn":["If the undulator field passes, electron orbit errors matter little.","The undulator consists of tens of 4 to 5 m modules joined by quadrupoles, phase shifters and BPMs.","Seeing X-rays on the detector means the FEL has saturated."],"answer":1,"explanation":"波盪器由數十段 4 到 5 m 的模組組成，段間以四極聚焦、相位器與 BPM 銜接。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The undulator consists of tens of 4 to 5 m modules joined by quadrupoles, phase shifters and BPMs. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a457-v12-26","title":"波盪器線整合：軌道直線度、相位匹配與種子化：定量估算","titleEn":"Undulator-line integration: trajectory straightness, phase matching and seeding: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「波盪器線與自種子晶體」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Undulator line and self-seeding crystal” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：軌道角度 x' 使電子比直線多走 Δs = ½∫x'²ds。在約兩個增益長度（3 m）內 x' = 2 µrad：Δs = ½×(2×10⁻⁶)²×3 = 6×10⁻¹² m，相對 0.1 nm 光的相位滑移 2π×6×10⁻¹²/10⁻¹⁰ ≈ 21.6°；x' = 1 µrad 時降為 5.4°。因此軌道角度要壓到約 1 µrad，相當於 3 m 內位置偏差約 3 µm。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: An orbit angle x' makes the electron travel Δs = ½∫x'²ds more than a straight path. With x' = 2 µrad over about two gain lengths (3 m), Δs = ½×(2×10⁻⁶)²×3 = 6×10⁻¹² m, a phase slip of 2π×6×10⁻¹²/10⁻¹⁰ ≈ 21.6° relative to 0.1 nm light; at x' = 1 µrad it falls to 5.4°. The orbit angle must therefore be held to about 1 µrad, equivalent to about 3 µm of position error over 3 m. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以束流基準對準：在數個不同電子能量下記錄 BPM 讀數，四極偏移造成的軌道會隨能量改變，解出各四極與 BPM 的偏移並修正，反覆進行到軌道對能量不敏感；再逐段關閉間隙量自發輻射與增益，並以相位器掃描找出各段之間脈衝能量最大的設定。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Use beam-based alignment: record BPM readings at several electron energies, since orbits caused by quadrupole offsets change with energy, solve for each quadrupole and BPM offset, correct, and iterate until the orbit is insensitive to energy; then close segments one by one to measure spontaneous emission and gain, and scan phase shifters to find the inter-segment settings that maximize pulse energy.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"軌道角度 x' 使電子比直線多走 Δs = ½∫x'²ds。在約兩個增益長度（3 m）內 x' = 2 µrad：Δs = ½×(2×10⁻⁶)²×3 = 6×10⁻¹² m，相對 0.1 nm 光的相位滑移 2π×6×10⁻¹²/10⁻¹⁰ ≈ 21.6°；x' = 1 µrad 時降為 5.4°。因此軌道角度要壓到約 1 µrad，相當於 3 m 內位置偏差約 3 µm。","textEn":"An orbit angle x' makes the electron travel Δs = ½∫x'²ds more than a straight path. With x' = 2 µrad over about two gain lengths (3 m), Δs = ½×(2×10⁻⁶)²×3 = 6×10⁻¹² m, a phase slip of 2π×6×10⁻¹²/10⁻¹⁰ ≈ 21.6° relative to 0.1 nm light; at x' = 1 µrad it falls to 5.4°. The orbit angle must therefore be held to about 1 µrad, equivalent to about 3 µm of position error over 3 m.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「波盪器線整合：軌道直線度、相位匹配與種子化」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Undulator-line integration: trajectory straightness, phase matching and seeding\", which statement holds?","options":["電子束能量散佈越小越好，降到零最理想。","只要加速到夠高能量，束團長度就會自動變短。","軌道角度 x' 使電子比直線多走 Δs = ½∫x'²ds。"],"optionsEn":["The smaller the energy spread the better; zero would be ideal.","Accelerating to high enough energy automatically shortens the bunch.","An orbit angle x' makes the electron travel Δs = ½∫x'²ds more than a straight path."],"answer":2,"explanation":"軌道角度 x' 使電子比直線多走 Δs = ½∫x'²ds。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"An orbit angle x' makes the electron travel Δs = ½∫x'²ds more than a straight path. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a457-v12-27","title":"波盪器線整合：軌道直線度、相位匹配與種子化：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Undulator-line integration: trajectory straightness, phase matching and seeding: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「波盪器線與自種子晶體」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Undulator line and self-seeding crystal” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以束流基準對準：在數個不同電子能量下記錄 BPM 讀數，四極偏移造成的軌道會隨能量改變，解出各四極與 BPM 的偏移並修正，反覆進行到軌道對能量不敏感；再逐段關閉間隙量自發輻射與增益，並以相位器掃描找出各段之間脈衝能量最大的設定。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Use beam-based alignment: record BPM readings at several electron energies, since orbits caused by quadrupole offsets change with energy, solve for each quadrupole and BPM offset, correct, and iterate until the orbit is insensitive to energy; then close segments one by one to measure spontaneous emission and gain, and scan phase shifters to find the inter-segment settings that maximize pulse energy. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：波盪器段因地基沉陷或溫度梯度偏移數十微米卻未重新對準，只有部分段貢獻增益，飽和點後移，脈衝能量下降一半；若自種子晶體處的電子軌道偏移，種子與電子不重疊，種子化效果消失而只剩 SASE。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Undulator segments shifted tens of micrometres by foundation settlement or thermal gradients, but not realigned, leave only some segments contributing gain, pushing saturation downstream and halving pulse energy; if the orbit at the self-seeding crystal is off, the seed and electrons do not overlap, seeding vanishes and only SASE remains.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以束流基準對準：在數個不同電子能量下記錄 BPM 讀數，四極偏移造成的軌道會隨能量改變，解出各四極與 BPM 的偏移並修正，反覆進行到軌道對能量不敏感；再逐段關閉間隙量自發輻射與增益，並以相位器掃描找出各段之間脈衝能量最大的設定。","textEn":"Use beam-based alignment: record BPM readings at several electron energies, since orbits caused by quadrupole offsets change with energy, solve for each quadrupole and BPM offset, correct, and iterate until the orbit is insensitive to energy; then close segments one by one to measure spontaneous emission and gain, and scan phase shifters to find the inter-segment settings that maximize pulse energy.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「波盪器線整合：軌道直線度、相位匹配與種子化」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Undulator-line integration: trajectory straightness, phase matching and seeding\"?","options":["以束流基準對準：在數個不同電子能量下記錄 BPM 讀數，四極偏移造成的軌道會隨能量改變，解出各四極與 BPM 的偏移並修正，反覆進行到軌道對能量不敏感。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","屏上看到的垂直長度就是束團長度，不必扣除束流本身的尺寸。"],"optionsEn":["Use beam-based alignment: record BPM readings at several electron energies, since orbits caused by quadrupole offsets change with energy, solve for each quadrupole and BPM offset, correct, and iterate until the orbit is insensitive to energy.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","The vertical length on the screen equals the bunch length with no need to remove the beam's own size."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以束流基準對準：在數個不同電子能量下記錄 BPM 讀數，四極偏移造成的軌道會隨能量改變，解出各四極與 BPM 的偏移並修正，反覆進行到軌道對能量不敏感；再逐段關閉間隙量自發輻射與增益，並以相位器掃描找出各段之間脈衝能量最大的設定。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Use beam-based alignment: record BPM readings at several electron energies, since orbits caused by quadrupole offsets change with energy, solve for each quadrupole and BPM offset, correct, and iterate until the orbit is insensitive to energy; then close segments one by one to measure spontaneous emission and gain, and scan phase shifters to find the inter-segment settings that maximize pulse energy. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a457-v12-28","title":"波盪器線整合：軌道直線度、相位匹配與種子化：失效診斷","titleEn":"Undulator-line integration: trajectory straightness, phase matching and seeding: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「波盪器線與自種子晶體」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Undulator line and self-seeding crystal” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"波盪器段因地基沉陷或溫度梯度偏移數十微米卻未重新對準，只有部分段貢獻增益，飽和點後移，脈衝能量下降一半；若自種子晶體處的電子軌道偏移，種子與電子不重疊，種子化效果消失而只剩 SASE。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Undulator segments shifted tens of micrometres by foundation settlement or thermal gradients, but not realigned, leave only some segments contributing gain, pushing saturation downstream and halving pulse energy; if the orbit at the self-seeding crystal is off, the seed and electrons do not overlap, seeding vanishes and only SASE remains. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：SASE 從雜訊起始，頻譜呈尖刺狀；硬 X 光自種子在中段插入鑽石晶體，以前半段 SASE 光經布拉格反射後的尾波作為窄頻種子，後半段只放大種子，使頻寬與穩定度大幅改善。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: SASE starts from noise and has a spiky spectrum; hard X-ray self-seeding inserts a diamond crystal mid-line where the Bragg-reflected wake of the first half's SASE light serves as a narrow-band seed, and the second half amplifies only the seed, greatly improving bandwidth and stability.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「波盪器只要磁場合格，電子軌道誤差影響不大。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"If the undulator field passes, electron orbit errors matter little.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"波盪器段因地基沉陷或溫度梯度偏移數十微米卻未重新對準，只有部分段貢獻增益，飽和點後移，脈衝能量下降一半；若自種子晶體處的電子軌道偏移，種子與電子不重疊，種子化效果消失而只剩 SASE。","textEn":"Undulator segments shifted tens of micrometres by foundation settlement or thermal gradients, but not realigned, leave only some segments contributing gain, pushing saturation downstream and halving pulse energy; if the orbit at the self-seeding crystal is off, the seed and electrons do not overlap, seeding vanishes and only SASE remains.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「波盪器線整合：軌道直線度、相位匹配與種子化」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Undulator-line integration: trajectory straightness, phase matching and seeding\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","波盪器段因地基沉陷或溫度梯度偏移數十微米卻未重新對準，只有部分段貢獻增益，飽和點後移，脈衝能量下降一半。","偵測器上看到 X 光，就表示 FEL 已經飽和。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Undulator segments shifted tens of micrometres by foundation settlement or thermal gradients, but not realigned, leave only some segments contributing gain, pushing saturation downstream and halving pulse energy.","Seeing X-rays on the detector means the FEL has saturated."],"answer":1,"explanation":"波盪器段因地基沉陷或溫度梯度偏移數十微米卻未重新對準，只有部分段貢獻增益，飽和點後移，脈衝能量下降一半；若自種子晶體處的電子軌道偏移，種子與電子不重疊，種子化效果消失而只剩 SASE。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Undulator segments shifted tens of micrometres by foundation settlement or thermal gradients, but not realigned, leave only some segments contributing gain, pushing saturation downstream and halving pulse energy; if the orbit at the self-seeding crystal is off, the seed and electrons do not overlap, seeding vanishes and only SASE remains. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a457-v12-29","title":"增益曲線、飽和脈衝能量與試運轉交接：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Gain curve, saturation pulse energy and commissioning handoff: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「增益曲線量測與交接紀錄」如何決定自由電子雷射加速器的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Gain-curve measurement and handoff record” determines the key performance of “Free-electron-laser accelerators”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"試運轉的核心證據是增益曲線：逐段打開波盪器間隙，或以軌道踢出使後段失效，量 X 光脈衝能量對有效波盪器長度的關係；指數增長段的斜率給出實際增益長度，轉平的位置給出飽和點。實測增益長度與由量測束流參數預測的三維值比較，可以判斷是發射度、能量散佈還是軌道誤差在吃掉增益。交接時要把操作點（電荷、壓縮設定、雷射加熱器能量、波盪器錐度）連同增益曲線、脈衝能量統計、波長穩定度與射頻抖動預算一起留下。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「增益曲線量測與交接紀錄」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The core commissioning evidence is the gain curve: open undulator gaps segment by segment, or kick the orbit to disable downstream sections, and measure X-ray pulse energy versus active undulator length; the slope of the exponential region gives the real gain length and the turnover gives the saturation point. Comparing the measured gain length with the three-dimensional prediction from measured beam parameters shows whether emittance, energy spread or orbit error is eating the gain. Handoff records the working point (charge, compression settings, laser-heater energy, undulator taper) together with the gain curve, pulse-energy statistics, wavelength stability and the RF jitter budget. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Gain-curve measurement and handoff record”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：在 z = 20 m 量到 10 µJ、z = 26 m 量到 400 µJ：L_g = Δz/ln(E₂/E₁) = 6/ln 40 ≈ 1.63 m，比一維值 1.39 m 長約 17%，屬三維效應的合理範圍。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Measuring 10 µJ at z = 20 m and 400 µJ at z = 26 m gives L_g = Δz/ln(E2/E1) = 6/ln 40 ≈ 1.63 m, about 17% longer than the one-dimensional 1.39 m and within the normal range of three-dimensional effects.","failure":"常見誤解：「偵測器上看到 X 光，就表示 FEL 已經飽和。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Seeing X-rays on the detector means the FEL has saturated.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「增益曲線量測與交接紀錄」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Gain-curve measurement and handoff record”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-29-k1","title":"增益曲線、飽和脈衝能量與試運轉交接","titleEn":"Gain curve, saturation pulse energy and commissioning handoff","text":"試運轉的核心證據是增益曲線：逐段打開波盪器間隙，或以軌道踢出使後段失效，量 X 光脈衝能量對有效波盪器長度的關係；指數增長段的斜率給出實際增益長度，轉平的位置給出飽和點。實測增益長度與由量測束流參數預測的三維值比較，可以判斷是發射度、能量散佈還是軌道誤差在吃掉增益。","textEn":"The core commissioning evidence is the gain curve: open undulator gaps segment by segment, or kick the orbit to disable downstream sections, and measure X-ray pulse energy versus active undulator length; the slope of the exponential region gives the real gain length and the turnover gives the saturation point. Comparing the measured gain length with the three-dimensional prediction from measured beam parameters shows whether emittance, energy spread or orbit error is eating the gain.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：偵測器上看到 X 光，就表示 FEL 已經飽和。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Seeing X-rays on the detector means the FEL has saturated. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「增益曲線、飽和脈衝能量與試運轉交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Gain curve, saturation pulse energy and commissioning handoff\" is correct?","options":["偵測器上看到 X 光，就表示 FEL 已經飽和。","FEL 的輸出波長由雷射介質決定，與電子能量無關。","試運轉的核心證據是增益曲線：逐段打開波盪器間隙，或以軌道踢出使後段失效，量 X 光脈衝能量對有效波盪器長度的關係。"],"optionsEn":["Seeing X-rays on the detector means the FEL has saturated.","An FEL's output wavelength is set by a lasing medium and is independent of electron energy.","The core commissioning evidence is the gain curve: open undulator gaps segment by segment, or kick the orbit to disable downstream sections, and measure X-ray pulse energy versus active undulator length."],"answer":2,"explanation":"試運轉的核心證據是增益曲線：逐段打開波盪器間隙，或以軌道踢出使後段失效，量 X 光脈衝能量對有效波盪器長度的關係；指數增長段的斜率給出實際增益長度，轉平的位置給出飽和點。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The core commissioning evidence is the gain curve: open undulator gaps segment by segment, or kick the orbit to disable downstream sections, and measure X-ray pulse energy versus active undulator length; the slope of the exponential region gives the real gain length and the turnover gives the saturation point. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a457-v12-30","title":"增益曲線、飽和脈衝能量與試運轉交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Gain curve, saturation pulse energy and commissioning handoff: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「增益曲線量測與交接紀錄」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Gain-curve measurement and handoff record” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：在 z = 20 m 量到 10 µJ、z = 26 m 量到 400 µJ：L_g = Δz/ln(E₂/E₁) = 6/ln 40 ≈ 1.63 m，比一維值 1.39 m 長約 17%，屬三維效應的合理範圍。飽和脈衝能量約為 ρ 乘以束團能量：4.9×10⁻⁴×200 pC×5.8 GV ≈ 0.57 mJ，在 12.4 keV 相當於 0.57 mJ/(12.4 keV×1.602×10⁻¹⁹ J/eV) ≈ 2.9×10¹¹ 個光子。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Measuring 10 µJ at z = 20 m and 400 µJ at z = 26 m gives L_g = Δz/ln(E2/E1) = 6/ln 40 ≈ 1.63 m, about 17% longer than the one-dimensional 1.39 m and within the normal range of three-dimensional effects. The saturation pulse energy is roughly ρ times the bunch energy, 4.9×10⁻⁴×200 pC×5.8 GV ≈ 0.57 mJ, which at 12.4 keV is 0.57 mJ/(12.4 keV×1.602×10⁻¹⁹ J/eV) ≈ 2.9×10¹¹ photons. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：增益曲線每點至少平均數百發，以壓低 SASE 的統計起伏，並以絕對校正的氣體偵測器與熱電型能量計交叉校正脈衝能量；以錐度掃描確認飽和後的能量提取；交接前連續運轉 24 小時，記錄脈衝能量、波長與到達時間的統計，作為日後比對的基準。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Average at least hundreds of shots per gain-curve point to suppress SASE statistical fluctuation, and cross-calibrate pulse energy between an absolutely calibrated gas detector and a thermal energy meter; scan the taper to confirm post-saturation energy extraction; before handoff run continuously for 24 hours logging pulse-energy, wavelength and arrival-time statistics as the baseline for later comparison.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"在 z = 20 m 量到 10 µJ、z = 26 m 量到 400 µJ：L_g = Δz/ln(E₂/E₁) = 6/ln 40 ≈ 1.63 m，比一維值 1.39 m 長約 17%，屬三維效應的合理範圍。飽和脈衝能量約為 ρ 乘以束團能量：4.9×10⁻⁴×200 pC×5.8 GV ≈ 0.57 mJ，在 12.4 keV 相當於 0.57 mJ/(12.4 keV×1.602×10⁻¹⁹ J/eV) ≈ 2.9×10¹¹ 個光子。","textEn":"Measuring 10 µJ at z = 20 m and 400 µJ at z = 26 m gives L_g = Δz/ln(E2/E1) = 6/ln 40 ≈ 1.63 m, about 17% longer than the one-dimensional 1.39 m and within the normal range of three-dimensional effects. The saturation pulse energy is roughly ρ times the bunch energy, 4.9×10⁻⁴×200 pC×5.8 GV ≈ 0.57 mJ, which at 12.4 keV is 0.57 mJ/(12.4 keV×1.602×10⁻¹⁹ J/eV) ≈ 2.9×10¹¹ photons.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「增益曲線、飽和脈衝能量與試運轉交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Gain curve, saturation pulse energy and commissioning handoff\", which statement holds?","options":["在 z = 20 m 量到 10 µJ、z = 26 m 量到 400 µJ：L_g = Δz/ln(E₂/E₁) = 6/ln 40 ≈ 1.63 m，比一維值 1.39 m 長約 17%，屬三維效應的合理範圍。","電子槍之後的加速器可以降低正規化發射度，補回電子槍的不足。","屏上看到的垂直長度就是束團長度，不必扣除束流本身的尺寸。"],"optionsEn":["Measuring 10 µJ at z = 20 m and 400 µJ at z = 26 m gives L_g = Δz/ln(E2/E1) = 6/ln 40 ≈ 1.63 m, about 17% longer than the one-dimensional 1.39 m and within the normal range of three-dimensional effects.","The linac after the gun can reduce normalized emittance and make up for a poor gun.","The vertical length on the screen equals the bunch length with no need to remove the beam's own size."],"answer":0,"explanation":"在 z = 20 m 量到 10 µJ、z = 26 m 量到 400 µJ：L_g = Δz/ln(E₂/E₁) = 6/ln 40 ≈ 1.63 m，比一維值 1.39 m 長約 17%，屬三維效應的合理範圍。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Measuring 10 µJ at z = 20 m and 400 µJ at z = 26 m gives L_g = Δz/ln(E2/E1) = 6/ln 40 ≈ 1.63 m, about 17% longer than the one-dimensional 1.39 m and within the normal range of three-dimensional effects. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a457-v12-31","title":"增益曲線、飽和脈衝能量與試運轉交接：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Gain curve, saturation pulse energy and commissioning handoff: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「增益曲線量測與交接紀錄」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Gain-curve measurement and handoff record” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"增益曲線每點至少平均數百發，以壓低 SASE 的統計起伏，並以絕對校正的氣體偵測器與熱電型能量計交叉校正脈衝能量；以錐度掃描確認飽和後的能量提取；交接前連續運轉 24 小時，記錄脈衝能量、波長與到達時間的統計，作為日後比對的基準。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Average at least hundreds of shots per gain-curve point to suppress SASE statistical fluctuation, and cross-calibrate pulse energy between an absolutely calibrated gas detector and a thermal energy meter; scan the taper to confirm post-saturation energy extraction; before handoff run continuously for 24 hours logging pulse-energy, wavelength and arrival-time statistics as the baseline for later comparison. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：只以單發最大脈衝能量宣稱達標而忽略平均值與起伏，使用者排程後發現平均脈衝能量只有宣稱值的一半，而且隨冷卻水溫度週期變化，原因是加速結構溫度造成的相位漂移從未納入回授。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Claiming success from the single highest-energy shot while ignoring mean and fluctuation leads users, once scheduled, to find average pulse energy half the claimed value and varying with the cooling-water temperature cycle, because structure-temperature phase drift was never included in feedback.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"增益曲線每點至少平均數百發，以壓低 SASE 的統計起伏，並以絕對校正的氣體偵測器與熱電型能量計交叉校正脈衝能量；以錐度掃描確認飽和後的能量提取；交接前連續運轉 24 小時，記錄脈衝能量、波長與到達時間的統計，作為日後比對的基準。","textEn":"Average at least hundreds of shots per gain-curve point to suppress SASE statistical fluctuation, and cross-calibrate pulse energy between an absolutely calibrated gas detector and a thermal energy meter; scan the taper to confirm post-saturation energy extraction; before handoff run continuously for 24 hours logging pulse-energy, wavelength and arrival-time statistics as the baseline for later comparison.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「增益曲線、飽和脈衝能量與試運轉交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Gain curve, saturation pulse energy and commissioning handoff\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","增益曲線每點至少平均數百發，以壓低 SASE 的統計起伏，並以絕對校正的氣體偵測器與熱電型能量計交叉校正脈衝能量。","射頻抖動只影響電子能量，不影響 X 光脈衝的到達時間。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Average at least hundreds of shots per gain-curve point to suppress SASE statistical fluctuation, and cross-calibrate pulse energy between an absolutely calibrated gas detector and a thermal energy meter.","RF jitter affects only electron energy, not the X-ray pulse arrival time."],"answer":1,"explanation":"增益曲線每點至少平均數百發，以壓低 SASE 的統計起伏，並以絕對校正的氣體偵測器與熱電型能量計交叉校正脈衝能量；以錐度掃描確認飽和後的能量提取；交接前連續運轉 24 小時，記錄脈衝能量、波長與到達時間的統計，作為日後比對的基準。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Average at least hundreds of shots per gain-curve point to suppress SASE statistical fluctuation, and cross-calibrate pulse energy between an absolutely calibrated gas detector and a thermal energy meter; scan the taper to confirm post-saturation energy extraction; before handoff run continuously for 24 hours logging pulse-energy, wavelength and arrival-time statistics as the baseline for later comparison. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a457-v12-32","title":"增益曲線、飽和脈衝能量與試運轉交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Gain curve, saturation pulse energy and commissioning handoff: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"prerequisiteIds":["a457-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「增益曲線量測與交接紀錄」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Gain-curve measurement and handoff record” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"只以單發最大脈衝能量宣稱達標而忽略平均值與起伏，使用者排程後發現平均脈衝能量只有宣稱值的一半，而且隨冷卻水溫度週期變化，原因是加速結構溫度造成的相位漂移從未納入回授。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Claiming success from the single highest-energy shot while ignoring mean and fluctuation leads users, once scheduled, to find average pulse energy half the claimed value and varying with the cooling-water temperature cycle, because structure-temperature phase drift was never included in feedback. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：交接時要把操作點（電荷、壓縮設定、雷射加熱器能量、波盪器錐度）連同增益曲線、脈衝能量統計、波長穩定度與射頻抖動預算一起留下。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Handoff records the working point (charge, compression settings, laser-heater energy, undulator taper) together with the gain curve, pulse-energy statistics, wavelength stability and the RF jitter budget.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「偵測器上看到 X 光，就表示 FEL 已經飽和。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Seeing X-rays on the detector means the FEL has saturated.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a457-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只以單發最大脈衝能量宣稱達標而忽略平均值與起伏，使用者排程後發現平均脈衝能量只有宣稱值的一半，而且隨冷卻水溫度週期變化，原因是加速結構溫度造成的相位漂移從未納入回授。","textEn":"Claiming success from the single highest-energy shot while ignoring mean and fluctuation leads users, once scheduled, to find average pulse energy half the claimed value and varying with the cooling-water temperature cycle, because structure-temperature phase drift was never included in feedback.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]},{"id":"a457-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「增益曲線、飽和脈衝能量與試運轉交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Gain curve, saturation pulse energy and commissioning handoff\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","FEL 的輸出波長由雷射介質決定，與電子能量無關。","只以單發最大脈衝能量宣稱達標而忽略平均值與起伏，使用者排程後發現平均脈衝能量只有宣稱值的一半，而且隨冷卻水溫度週期變化，原因是加速結構溫度造成的相位漂移從未納入回授。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","An FEL's output wavelength is set by a lasing medium and is independent of electron energy.","Claiming success from the single highest-energy shot while ignoring mean and fluctuation leads users, once scheduled, to find average pulse energy half the claimed value and varying with the cooling-water temperature cycle, because structure-temperature phase drift was never included in feedback."],"answer":2,"explanation":"只以單發最大脈衝能量宣稱達標而忽略平均值與起伏，使用者排程後發現平均脈衝能量只有宣稱值的一半，而且隨冷卻水溫度週期變化，原因是加速結構溫度造成的相位漂移從未納入回授。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Claiming success from the single highest-energy shot while ignoring mean and fluctuation leads users, once scheduled, to find average pulse energy half the claimed value and varying with the cooling-water temperature cycle, because structure-temperature phase drift was never included in feedback. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-xfel-how-it-works","v12o-lcls-overview","v12o-lcls-machine-parameters"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
